%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: -622809992, guid: 76ad3cbe9d98d83f7de53e0a92768023, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e74d80136420ae64d8590b92c6911c88, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 335890120228864
    m_Localized: Hello! It is I, Georgio!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 336281029361664
    m_Localized: Yes, *that* Georgio.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216455348224
    m_Localized: The GREATEST scavenger in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542528
    m_Localized: You are lucky. Georgio has brought you his latest find.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542529
    m_Localized: Look! Relics from an ancient alien civilization...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542530
    m_Localized: Good. Remarkable, even!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542531
    m_Localized: Until my next great find, my friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542532
    m_Localized: Wait? What did Georgio do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542533
    m_Localized: Keep it down, old man. You're coming with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542534
    m_Localized: Hello once more!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542535
    m_Localized: You remember me, friend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542536
    m_Localized: Today, Georgio brings you an invention all of his own...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542537
    m_Localized: Georgio wanted to give you the chance to be the first to stock it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542538
    m_Localized: Gaze upon... the water of tomorrow!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542539
    m_Localized: Georgio is back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542540
    m_Localized: I have found 100% genuine heminwai cigarettes,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542541
    m_Localized: You want to buy some?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542542
    m_Localized: Special price for you my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542543
    m_Localized: Yes, yes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542544
    m_Localized: See you soon my friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542545
    m_Localized: No, wait! Georgio is innocent!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542546
    m_Localized: Whatever, you are coming with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542547
    m_Localized: Guess who?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542548
    m_Localized: Georgio is back again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542549
    m_Localized: Georgio has been scavenging on the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542550
    m_Localized: What is there to scavenge on the Upper Levels?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542551
    m_Localized: For you? Georgio give 25% off for everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542552
    m_Localized: Yes, yes, very good!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542553
    m_Localized: Goodbye, my friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542554
    m_Localized: More riches Georgio shall bring you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542555
    m_Localized: Oh no no no, not again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542556
    m_Localized: Hey! there's the old man who broke into the women's bath house in the Upper Levels!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542557
    m_Localized: You're coming with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542558
    m_Localized: Hello once more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542559
    m_Localized: Georgio has returned.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542560
    m_Localized: See what Georgio has for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542561
    m_Localized: Interesting stuff, no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542562
    m_Localized: Where did you find this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542563
    m_Localized: Good scavs never reveal his spots!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542564
    m_Localized: You want this? Or not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542565
    m_Localized: Georgio can always find another buyer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542566
    m_Localized: Aha! Georgio knew you would like it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542567
    m_Localized: Until next time, my friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542568
    m_Localized: Save your credits for Georgio.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542569
    m_Localized: What? Did you snitch on Georgio?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542570
    m_Localized: There you are. You're under arrest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542571
    m_Localized: How do you keep breaking into the evidence room?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542572
    m_Localized: Georgio is a good friend, no?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542573
    m_Localized: He sees you forgetting your stuff at the Dumping Grounds last night...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542574
    m_Localized: Does he scavenge? No! He brings it back for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542575
    m_Localized: No need for thanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542576
    m_Localized: There you are, my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542577
    m_Localized: Georgio needs your help...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542578
    m_Localized: He is building a space ship! To scavenge across the system...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542579
    m_Localized: It is almost finished, but... Georgio has run out of Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542580
    m_Localized: Would you be so kind, my friend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542581
    m_Localized: Really? That was easy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542582
    m_Localized: Take this. Georgio won't need where he is going...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542583
    m_Localized: You will be paid back with interest! Georgio guarantee!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542584
    m_Localized: See you in the stars, my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542585
    m_Localized: You're sure? Thank you, thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542586
    m_Localized: Here, for you. Georgio won't need it anymore...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542587
    m_Localized: I see... no trouble, my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542588
    m_Localized: Georgio will scavenge what he needs to finish the ship from the Dumping Grounds!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542589
    m_Localized: Good health, friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542590
    m_Localized: No... please! Have mercy on Georgio!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542591
    m_Localized: You have the right to remain silent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542592
    m_Localized: You are coming with us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542593
    m_Localized: No, your eyes do not deceive you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542594
    m_Localized: Georgio has returned from the stars!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542595
    m_Localized: Here are your Credits, paid back with interest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542596
    m_Localized: Now, Georgio will return to his ship...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542597
    m_Localized: The universe won't scavenge itself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542598
    m_Localized: Hello, I am traveling from the Core Sectors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542599
    m_Localized: I want to taste every food in the galaxy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542600
    m_Localized: I am buying one of each food and beverage you have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542601
    m_Localized: I give you 2 days to prepare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542602
    m_Localized: That's good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542603
    m_Localized: Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542604
    m_Localized: See ya.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542605
    m_Localized: I JUST WANT TO BUY SOME FOODS!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542606
    m_Localized: Quiet, you are coming with us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542607
    m_Localized: Hello, I am back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542608
    m_Localized: I want to taste every food in the galaxy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542609
    m_Localized: I am buying one of each food and beverage you have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542610
    m_Localized: I am willing to pay more for variety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542611
    m_Localized: Hello, I need to sell this quickly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542612
    m_Localized: There is too much heat on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542613
    m_Localized: Greetings, citizen, it's Officer Lun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542614
    m_Localized: I'm on patrol today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542615
    m_Localized: But I forgot my lunchbox. You got any food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542616
    m_Localized: I'll take it, sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542617
    m_Localized: No, I want food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542618
    m_Localized: That will do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542619
    m_Localized: Help! I need some meds, now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542620
    m_Localized: Some guy in a grey jumpsuit jumped me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542621
    m_Localized: I don't care if it's contraband, just give me something strong!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542622
    m_Localized: This is off the books.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542623
    m_Localized: Yes, good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542624
    m_Localized: No, I need something for the pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216459542625
    m_Localized: Shit, I'll take it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736832
    m_Localized: That should help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736833
    m_Localized: Hey, I... uh... found some stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736834
    m_Localized: You buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736835
    m_Localized: Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736836
    m_Localized: Wait, what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736837
    m_Localized: Hey! That's the guy who ambushed Officer Lun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736838
    m_Localized: Get him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736839
    m_Localized: Shit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736840
    m_Localized: Hello, I am back on duty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736841
    m_Localized: After a little vacation in the Medbay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736842
    m_Localized: This is just a routine check-in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736843
    m_Localized: While I'm here, I'll take some meds for pain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736844
    m_Localized: Something strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736845
    m_Localized: Emergency use only, of course...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736846
    m_Localized: Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736847
    m_Localized: Thanks, I guess. This stuff is expensive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736848
    m_Localized: No, that's not the kind of med I need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736849
    m_Localized: Synaprest? You think I have a problem?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736850
    m_Localized: Even if I did, I could never afford this stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736851
    m_Localized: I'll take it, sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736852
    m_Localized: Yeah, looks good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736853
    m_Localized: Hey you, it's your lucky day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736854
    m_Localized: Requisition has approved the sale of some... surplus items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736855
    m_Localized: You interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736856
    m_Localized: Strictly confidential, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736857
    m_Localized: I'm authorized to give you 33% off, if you take everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736858
    m_Localized: Very good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736859
    m_Localized: Wait, wait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736860
    m_Localized: Officer Lun? What's going on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736861
    m_Localized: This is the missing equipment from the Armory!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736862
    m_Localized: Wait... I can explain!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736863
    m_Localized: Come quietly, Officer. You know what happens if you don't.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736864
    m_Localized: This is a surprise inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736865
    m_Localized: Open up, now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736866
    m_Localized: I found some narcotics. They will be seized.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736867
    m_Localized: Hey, don't complain. You are lucky I am not taking you in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736868
    m_Localized: '<i>*Sigh*</i>, all clear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736869
    m_Localized: Hmm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736870
    m_Localized: Officer Lun. What are you doing here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736871
    m_Localized: I am... uh... conducting a surprise inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736872
    m_Localized: You are supposed to be on desk duty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736873
    m_Localized: We know what you're up to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736874
    m_Localized: You are under arrest for abuse of power.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736875
    m_Localized: Oh, so this is what passes for a shop down here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736876
    m_Localized: Charming. I suppose it works if you've never seen a proper storefront.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736877
    m_Localized: You there, I'll need some food until I can return to the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736878
    m_Localized: It won't be long until they realize what blunder they made.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736879
    m_Localized: They jailed my mother, who runs the biggest hydroponic on the station, for embezzlement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736880
    m_Localized: Ridiculous, half this station eats because of her!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736881
    m_Localized: So do you have anything? Preferably fresh? Some Variety would be good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736882
    m_Localized: I can't believe I am stuck here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736883
    m_Localized: No news of my mother and they are not letting me back up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736884
    m_Localized: Why is this happening to me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736885
    m_Localized: I hate it down here, this is so unfair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736886
    m_Localized: '<i>*sigh*</i>, do you have household supplies?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736887
    m_Localized: looks like I will be here for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736888
    m_Localized: I found a decent room across the Commissary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736889
    m_Localized: It's tiny but at least it doesn't smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736890
    m_Localized: I can't believe people live like this their whole life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736891
    m_Localized: Hey, I am back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736892
    m_Localized: I'm starting to run low on fund.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736893
    m_Localized: They didn't let me bring much with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736894
    m_Localized: If I can just get back up there,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736895
    m_Localized: I could explain everything and clear our names,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736896
    m_Localized: and everything can go back to normal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736897
    m_Localized: I won't have to eat Nutrifruit for every meal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736898
    m_Localized: Anyways, I got some of my stuff to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736899
    m_Localized: I can't anymore,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736900
    m_Localized: I am out of funds,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736901
    m_Localized: A thief took the little I had left last night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736902
    m_Localized: Don't know what to do,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736903
    m_Localized: The trial is over and they found my mother guilty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736904
    m_Localized: I am stuck here forever and mom will rot in prison.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736905
    m_Localized: I can't believe I am asking this,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736906
    m_Localized: but could you spare me some food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736907
    m_Localized: I'll take anything, please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736908
    m_Localized: Thank you so much, I won't forget this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736909
    m_Localized: Hey! I am back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736910
    m_Localized: After our last talk,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736911
    m_Localized: I realized that I have to move forward,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736912
    m_Localized: Besides, I am getting used to the bad smell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736913
    m_Localized: Someone in the Upper Levels probably framed my mother,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736914
    m_Localized: I have to get my life back together and find a way to clear her,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736915
    m_Localized: First step is to secure an income.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736916
    m_Localized: So I figured I should scavenge in the Dumping Grounds,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736917
    m_Localized: My roommate gave me a crash course on scavenging,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736918
    m_Localized: I must say, there's a real sense of community here,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736919
    m_Localized: Anyways, take a look at what I got!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736920
    m_Localized: Hello! I am Cadet Serpico, new to Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736921
    m_Localized: It's my first day on duty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736922
    m_Localized: I am born and raised here in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736923
    m_Localized: Keeping the station safe has always been my dream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736924
    m_Localized: Sure, some members of my family now think that I am a traitor...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736925
    m_Localized: But I will work hard to improve Security from within.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736926
    m_Localized: Anyways, you got any snacks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736927
    m_Localized: I'll use them to make friends with my new colleagues.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736928
    m_Localized: Oh god, I gonna need a drink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736929
    m_Localized: Security is not what I expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736930
    m_Localized: I thought there might be a few bad Nutrifruits in the department, but this is beyond what I imagined.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736931
    m_Localized: I saw officers taking bribes from Upper Levels, the Cartel and even revolutionaries!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736932
    m_Localized: How deep does this go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736933
    m_Localized: '*Beep Beep*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736934
    m_Localized: Shit, I gotta go soon, just got paged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736935
    m_Localized: You got something I can take with me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736936
    m_Localized: What a happy day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736937
    m_Localized: I just talked to my superior about the corruption I saw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736938
    m_Localized: They are opening an full internal investigation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736939
    m_Localized: I might get fast-tracked for promotion for this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736940
    m_Localized: Can you sell me some food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736941
    m_Localized: No drinks this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736942
    m_Localized: Hello Citizen,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736943
    m_Localized: Have you seen a security cadet by the name of Serpico?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736944
    m_Localized: We have a warrant out for his arrest on corruption charges.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736945
    m_Localized: He was also found drinking on duty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736946
    m_Localized: Make sure to report him immediately if you see him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736947
    m_Localized: Do not try to communicate with him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736948
    m_Localized: He is considered armed and dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736949
    m_Localized: We are offering a reward for 300 Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736950
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me, Serpico.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736951
    m_Localized: They are trying to pin everything on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736952
    m_Localized: You gotta believe me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736953
    m_Localized: Gotta go now, they are looking for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736954
    m_Localized: I'll hide in Dumping Grounds for a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736955
    m_Localized: No, wait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736956
    m_Localized: He's reaching! He's reaching!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736957
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736958
    m_Localized: Suspect down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736959
    m_Localized: Let's get him secured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736960
    m_Localized: Hello! Good to see this shop open again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736961
    m_Localized: It was hard for me to find snacks after this store closed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736962
    m_Localized: I heard the previous shopkeeper got kidnapped in the night or something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736963
    m_Localized: Anyway, I am Chief Engineer Nellis,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736964
    m_Localized: 'Yes yes, *The* Chief Engineer. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736965
    m_Localized: You can just call me Nellis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736966
    m_Localized: I'm in charge of maintaining this old rusty station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736967
    m_Localized: What? Are you surprised to see a Command officer down here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736968
    m_Localized: Not all of us spend all day sitting on the Bridge, you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736969
    m_Localized: Unlike those Corporate Representatives and Upper-Level Councilors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736970
    m_Localized: People tend to forget, but most of the station's essential machinery is in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736971
    m_Localized: Anyway, you got food or what?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736972
    m_Localized: Hey, it's Nellis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736973
    m_Localized: You got any beer or snacks?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736974
    m_Localized: Just finished a some major repairs down in the auxiliary life support systems.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736975
    m_Localized: The Captain's gonna love to hear that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736976
    m_Localized: Lot of people down here don't think much of the Captain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736977
    m_Localized: Thinking he only serve the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736978
    m_Localized: But he is really fighting to keep this station together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736979
    m_Localized: Between the Upper Levels always demanding more, the corporate pressure,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736980
    m_Localized: the lack of external help from the Republic and those radical Revolutionaries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736981
    m_Localized: They wouldn't understand. Only a few can see the big picture.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736982
    m_Localized: Say what you want but the quality of live has slowly improved since he took command.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736983
    m_Localized: And no major armed conflicts on the station since then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736984
    m_Localized: Hey, it's Nellis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736985
    m_Localized: Got some broken modules here that I just replaced.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736986
    m_Localized: I thought you might be interested in buying them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736987
    m_Localized: Hey, it's Nellis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736988
    m_Localized: Just got back from a meeting with Command.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736989
    m_Localized: I just can't stand those Upper Level Councilors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736990
    m_Localized: They are completely out of touch with the reality of this station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736991
    m_Localized: You won't believe half of the stuff they propose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736992
    m_Localized: Good thing the heads of departments are here to keep them in check.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736993
    m_Localized: I am gonna need some drinks and treats to forget about that meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736994
    m_Localized: The previous tenant left some stuff behind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736995
    m_Localized: So they are mine now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736996
    m_Localized: Want to buy any of it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736997
    m_Localized: Big discounts if you take them all, for you only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736998
    m_Localized: Ah, new shop in the area. Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463736999
    m_Localized: Too many people, too few good shops.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737000
    m_Localized: I am Grandpa Cheng, I also run a small store in The Sector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737001
    m_Localized: I am supposed to get a food shipment from my supplier yesterday,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737002
    m_Localized: but they are late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737003
    m_Localized: Some of my customers cannot wait. Orphans. Old workers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737004
    m_Localized: So I would like to buy food from you that I will resell in my store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737005
    m_Localized: Same price as I always sell them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737006
    m_Localized: Which means... I will lose money today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737007
    m_Localized: I can't raise prices, or someone will starve.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737008
    m_Localized: So you got any food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737009
    m_Localized: Hello, Grandpa Cheng sent me here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737010
    m_Localized: I am looking to buy some meds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737011
    m_Localized: Grandpa Cheng usually have some expired but still usable meds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737012
    m_Localized: And his prices are always fair.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737013
    m_Localized: Sometime, he even sell them on credit for people who can't pay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737014
    m_Localized: Credit! In the Lower Levels! can you believe that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737015
    m_Localized: But he is out of stock right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737016
    m_Localized: So he told me to come to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737017
    m_Localized: Hello, it's me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737018
    m_Localized: My water purifier broke down last night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737019
    m_Localized: I've had it for many years, it's an old stubborn machine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737020
    m_Localized: Just like me, I guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737021
    m_Localized: My supplier suggested I replace it with a new one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737022
    m_Localized: He also suggested I should not be the one maintaining it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737023
    m_Localized: I guess he is telling me to retire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737024
    m_Localized: I am tired, but my customers depend on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737025
    m_Localized: Besides, It's not like I can afford it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737026
    m_Localized: Anyway, do you have any materials I can use to fix it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737027
    m_Localized: Hello, it's me. <i>*cough*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737028
    m_Localized: I got some stuff to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737029
    m_Localized: Sometimes people donate things to me, as a way to thank me I guess.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737030
    m_Localized: Someone even left me Luxury Items in my trash can!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737031
    m_Localized: Over time, I accumulated stuffs that won't interest my usual customers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737032
    m_Localized: Want to take a look? <i>*cough*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737033
    m_Localized: Hello, it's Sawyer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737034
    m_Localized: You know Grandpa Cheng right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737035
    m_Localized: The old man gave me food when I was a street urchin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737036
    m_Localized: I would starved if it wasn't for him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737037
    m_Localized: I heard he has been opening his store late
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737038
    m_Localized: and having less stock recently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737039
    m_Localized: To be honest, I am worried about him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737040
    m_Localized: Keep an eye on him, will you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737041
    m_Localized: Hello, it's me. <i>*cough*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737042
    m_Localized: I got a favor to ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737043
    m_Localized: I am diagnosed with an illness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737044
    m_Localized: It's possible to treat it, but the treatment might kill me at my age.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737045
    m_Localized: So I have decided to forgo treatment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737046
    m_Localized: I am selling the store and donating my savings to Lower Levels charities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737047
    m_Localized: I would loved finding someone to take over my store,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737048
    m_Localized: but I doubt anyone would want it with my margins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737049
    m_Localized: I got some leftover food items, Can you donate them to the food banks for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737050
    m_Localized: Hello there,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737051
    m_Localized: I got some sad news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737052
    m_Localized: I believe you know Grandpa Cheng?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737053
    m_Localized: He passed away last night in his sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737054
    m_Localized: He was a good man, a true pillar of the Lower Levels community.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737055
    m_Localized: I got something for you to remember him by.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737056
    m_Localized: Hey, I run a water purification business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737057
    m_Localized: I got a lot of Basewater here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737058
    m_Localized: I'll give you a big discount if you buy it all!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737059
    m_Localized: Hey, I've got some water to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737060
    m_Localized: Listen, I've got some water to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737061
    m_Localized: I need cash, fast, so buy it all and I'll knock the price down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737064
    m_Localized: I found some water when I was scavenging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737065
    m_Localized: It's labeled Ghostwater. Spooky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737066
    m_Localized: I got some water here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737067
    m_Localized: Pretty sure this is Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737068
    m_Localized: I got some extra gears I am not using.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737069
    m_Localized: Want anything?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737070
    m_Localized: 33% off if you take everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737071
    m_Localized: Shit
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216463737072
    m_Localized: FREEZE! That's the guy who's ambushing our officers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931136
    m_Localized: You are coming with us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931137
    m_Localized: I just came back from the Abandoned Sections.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931138
    m_Localized: I found some good stuff, take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931139
    m_Localized: 25% off if you take everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931140
    m_Localized: I need to buy some food and material
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931141
    m_Localized: You got any?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931142
    m_Localized: Don't press your alarm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931143
    m_Localized: My name is Odin, Odin Haraldsson.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931144
    m_Localized: I have a business proposition for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931145
    m_Localized: Report me, and you'll never see me again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931146
    m_Localized: My people are in need of some supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931147
    m_Localized: I am talking guns, ammo, armor, poison, supply crates and access cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931148
    m_Localized: Contraband is no issue for us, but we won't pay you as much as you might get elsewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931149
    m_Localized: Take this card and give me a call when you have something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931150
    m_Localized: You will regret this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931151
    m_Localized: Odin Haraldsson... at last. You are under arrest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931152
    m_Localized: Hello, it's me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931153
    m_Localized: What do you have for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931154
    m_Localized: Remember, we want weapons, ammo, armor, supply crates, poison and access cards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931155
    m_Localized: What? You traitor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931156
    m_Localized: Keep you hands up! You are under arrest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931157
    m_Localized: Hello, ain't you a cute Nutrifruit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931158
    m_Localized: My name's Lou, pleased to meet ya.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931159
    m_Localized: I need some stuff to help a "guest" of mine to "chat" with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931160
    m_Localized: I am thinking stuff like a pipe, kitchen knife, maybe a cleaver?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931161
    m_Localized: He is very reserved, you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931162
    m_Localized: I want a varieties of fun stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931163
    m_Localized: Anyways, I am sure you know better than calling Security on me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931164
    m_Localized: So, what's it gonna be?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931165
    m_Localized: Hahaha, this is gonna be so fun!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931166
    m_Localized: SHH-SHIT, it's her!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931167
    m_Localized: '*Tries to hide their face from Lou.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931168
    m_Localized: FREEZE! YOU ARE UNDER ARREST!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931169
    m_Localized: The brig's ain't gonna hold me for long. <i>wink</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931170
    m_Localized: See you soon, Nutrifruit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931171
    m_Localized: Boo!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931172
    m_Localized: Haha, did I scare you, Nutrifruit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931173
    m_Localized: Missed me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931174
    m_Localized: It was not very nice of you to call Security on me last time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931175
    m_Localized: At least buy a girl a drink first.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931176
    m_Localized: Usually I would just kill you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931177
    m_Localized: But you are either very brave or dumb,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931178
    m_Localized: either way, I want to play some games with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931179
    m_Localized: You can guess what will happen to you if you don't play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931180
    m_Localized: Security won't be bothering us anymore,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931181
    m_Localized: I paid a visit to the sector chief's home last night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931182
    m_Localized: I'll be in touch. See you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931183
    m_Localized: Hello, My name is Li Bei Wen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931184
    m_Localized: Please don't report me, I am innocent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931185
    m_Localized: I am about to finish developing a new painkiller.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931186
    m_Localized: A non-addictive version of Oxymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931187
    m_Localized: I assume the big pharma companies don't want this on the market,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931188
    m_Localized: Somehow they got Security to label me as an armed cartel cook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931189
    m_Localized: I need funds to finish my research.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931190
    m_Localized: I got some samples to sell, please take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931191
    m_Localized: No! My research!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931192
    m_Localized: You are coming with us. Cartel Scum!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931193
    m_Localized: Got some extra food to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931194
    m_Localized: I have more in the future if you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931195
    m_Localized: Hello, please don't report me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931196
    m_Localized: Since my name is too common,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931197
    m_Localized: there's been a mix up with Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931198
    m_Localized: They put my face on the wanted poster instead of that robber!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931199
    m_Localized: Please, I am just a normal guy trying to get some groceries!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931200
    m_Localized: They arrest me 4 times already this month!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931201
    m_Localized: Noooo, why did you do it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931202
    m_Localized: You are coming with us. Scum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931203
    m_Localized: Ah man,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931204
    m_Localized: Impersonating a security officer is a serious crime!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931205
    m_Localized: You are gonna tell us where you got that uniform from, scum!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931206
    m_Localized: I just got back from a run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931207
    m_Localized: Scavenging's tough work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931208
    m_Localized: Been scraping by in the ruins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931209
    m_Localized: It's dangerous out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931210
    m_Localized: I need something to keep me alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931211
    m_Localized: I need protection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931212
    m_Localized: Got anything rugged and reliable?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931213
    m_Localized: Looking for something cheap but effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931214
    m_Localized: I need a weapon that can handle rough use.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931215
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits. Can you help me out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931216
    m_Localized: Only {0} Credits to spare. What can I get?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931217
    m_Localized: My budget's tight—{0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931218
    m_Localized: This won't help me survive out there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931219
    m_Localized: This will do. Thanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931220
    m_Localized: The station feels more dangerous these days...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931221
    m_Localized: I need something for personal protection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931222
    m_Localized: Crime's on the rise. I can't take chances anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931223
    m_Localized: Got any affordable self-defense gear?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931224
    m_Localized: I'm looking for a basic weapon and armor, nothing fancy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931225
    m_Localized: What's the cheapest thing that will keep me safe?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931226
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931227
    m_Localized: My budget is {0} Credits. Can you work with that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931228
    m_Localized: This is all I have—{0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931229
    m_Localized: This doesn't look like something I can defend myself with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931230
    m_Localized: Perfect! This will help me feel safer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931231
    m_Localized: I need to equip my team for a high-risk mission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931232
    m_Localized: We're beefing up security. Got anything suitable?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931233
    m_Localized: Looking for some serious firepower for my crew.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931234
    m_Localized: Only the best gear will do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931235
    m_Localized: I need weapons that are reliable and effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931236
    m_Localized: Looking for top-tier equipment, no junk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931237
    m_Localized: We've got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931238
    m_Localized: My budget is {0} Credits. Show me what you've got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931239
    m_Localized: Our limit is {0} Credits. Let's see your inventory.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931240
    m_Localized: This is not up to the standards my team needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931241
    m_Localized: Good. My team will appreciate this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931242
    m_Localized: I need something, anything to keep me going!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931243
    m_Localized: Please, I need a fix! Anything will do!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931244
    m_Localized: Do you have anything to calm my nerves?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931245
    m_Localized: Pills, smoke, or drink, I don't care.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931246
    m_Localized: Anything to take the edge off will do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931247
    m_Localized: I'm desperate. What can you give me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931248
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits. Is that enough?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931249
    m_Localized: Can {0} Credits get me something?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931250
    m_Localized: This is all I have {0} Credits. Will it do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931251
    m_Localized: I need something to take the edge off, not this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931252
    m_Localized: That's perfect, I'll take it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931253
    m_Localized: I just got back from a long haul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931254
    m_Localized: Finally back on the station after weeks in the void.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931255
    m_Localized: Been out in deep space too long, need to unwind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931256
    m_Localized: Got anything to help me relax?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931257
    m_Localized: Looking for something to ease the tension.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931258
    m_Localized: I need something to help me chill out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931259
    m_Localized: I have {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931260
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits is all I can spare.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931261
    m_Localized: My budget's {0} Credits, what can you offer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931262
    m_Localized: I want relaxants, not this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931263
    m_Localized: This will do nicely, thanks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931264
    m_Localized: I need water! You got Basewater?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931265
    m_Localized: I'll take Ghostwater too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931266
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931267
    m_Localized: Please, I can't leave without something to drink.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931268
    m_Localized: I want Basewater! Ghostwater is okay too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931269
    m_Localized: That looks good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931270
    m_Localized: I need something to drink, fast. Got Basewater?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931271
    m_Localized: High-Quality Water would be perfect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931272
    m_Localized: I have {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931273
    m_Localized: I want Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931274
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931275
    m_Localized: I'm stocking up on water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931276
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931277
    m_Localized: I'm looking for Basewater or better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931278
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931279
    m_Localized: You! I want to buy some water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931280
    m_Localized: Basewater, or High-Quality if you've got it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931281
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931282
    m_Localized: I want Basewater. High-Quality Water will do to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931283
    m_Localized: That looks good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931284
    m_Localized: Hello, I am building a stockpile of water for a client in the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931285
    m_Localized: I need High-Quality or Pure water, nothing less.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931286
    m_Localized: Don't try anything, I got water testing strips.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931287
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931288
    m_Localized: I want Pure Water or High-Quality Water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931289
    m_Localized: Looks good to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931290
    m_Localized: I'd like to buy some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931291
    m_Localized: And I got {0} Credits to spend
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931292
    m_Localized: I'm starving, what do you have cheap?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931293
    m_Localized: I've only got {0} Credits left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931294
    m_Localized: Hey, I need ingredients for my food stall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931295
    m_Localized: Gonna need a variety of stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931296
    m_Localized: I've got a budget of {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931297
    m_Localized: Hello, I am looking for food to supply our next expedition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931298
    m_Localized: And I got a budget of {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931299
    m_Localized: Hello, I am a private chef from the upper levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931300
    m_Localized: I am looking for exotic ingredients and unique food items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931301
    m_Localized: I was told your store carry such items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931302
    m_Localized: Hello.. I am not feeling so good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931303
    m_Localized: Do you have meds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931304
    m_Localized: Please, my child is sick. Do you have medicine?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931305
    m_Localized: I don't have much, just {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931306
    m_Localized: 'I run a clinic in the lower levels. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931307
    m_Localized: Do you have meds for my patients?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931308
    m_Localized: I need a variety of medical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931309
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits to work with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931310
    m_Localized: I got a Chemical Scanner with me, just letting you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931311
    m_Localized: Let's see what you got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931312
    m_Localized: Hello, I am sourcing medical supplies for our clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931313
    m_Localized: I was told you have a respectable selection of medical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931314
    m_Localized: I have a Chemical Scanner with me, so don't try anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931315
    m_Localized: Let's see what you got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931316
    m_Localized: Hello, I am the supplier for the Upper Levels General Hospital
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931317
    m_Localized: We heard of your impressive medical stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931318
    m_Localized: I am here to see them for myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931319
    m_Localized: I have a Chemical Scanner with me, so no funny business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931320
    m_Localized: Hello, I need Materials, Energy Cells and Tools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931321
    m_Localized: I've got a budget of {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931322
    m_Localized: I'm looking for cheap scrap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931323
    m_Localized: Any material, energy cell or industrial tools.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931324
    m_Localized: Got any lying around?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931325
    m_Localized: I can spare {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931326
    m_Localized: I'm doing repairs around the station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931327
    m_Localized: Do you have materials, energy cells or tools I can use?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931328
    m_Localized: I am repairing all kind of stuffs so I need variety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931329
    m_Localized: I have {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931330
    m_Localized: Why Hello Shopkeeper, I am an inventor!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931331
    m_Localized: I am seeking Materials, Energy Cells, Tools and Modules.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931332
    m_Localized: Hello, I am looking for Materials, Energy Cells and Modules
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931333
    m_Localized: I heard you have the good stuffs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931334
    m_Localized: I forgot what I came out for... Household Goods?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931335
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931336
    m_Localized: I just moved in. Got any cheap Household Goods?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931337
    m_Localized: No more than {0} Credits, sorry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931338
    m_Localized: Hello, I need to buy some household essentials for my family.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931339
    m_Localized: I need a variety of items
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931340
    m_Localized: I've got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931341
    m_Localized: Hello, I would like to buy some household item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931342
    m_Localized: Hello, I am shopping for household items for my employer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931343
    m_Localized: Show me your best stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931344
    m_Localized: I got too much food, you buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931345
    m_Localized: Picked up too many meds, need to unload some. Interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931346
    m_Localized: Got some spare medical stock if you want to deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931347
    m_Localized: Got too much stock, you interested in buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931348
    m_Localized: Excess product burning a hole in my pocket. You buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931349
    m_Localized: I got too much stock right now, take your pick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931350
    m_Localized: Extra weapons and armor lying around. You interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931351
    m_Localized: I bought too many materials, you buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931352
    m_Localized: I got too much material. You interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931353
    m_Localized: Hello, I have your order from Red Imp
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931354
    m_Localized: Excellent, goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931355
    m_Localized: Hey, I am from GP Mining
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931356
    m_Localized: Here's the goods
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931357
    m_Localized: Excellent, goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931358
    m_Localized: Hey, I got your stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931359
    m_Localized: I'll buy any chemical supplies too
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931360
    m_Localized: Excellent, goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931361
    m_Localized: Hello, our mutual friend sent me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931362
    m_Localized: Excellent, goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931363
    m_Localized: Hey, I got some stuff I don't need anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931364
    m_Localized: Take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931365
    m_Localized: Hey, I can teach you about scrapping ruined machine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931366
    m_Localized: I'll give you some tools to get started
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931367
    m_Localized: I'll let my Scrapper friends know that you are in business
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931368
    m_Localized: Scrapper will start bringing ruined machines to you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931369
    m_Localized: Sometime the ruined machines will still have modules inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931370
    m_Localized: Anything left inside by the Scrapper is usually stuck
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931371
    m_Localized: You can use the Module Extractor to get it out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931372
    m_Localized: If you have a screwdriver or wirecutter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931373
    m_Localized: You can use them on the machine to get extra materials out
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931374
    m_Localized: Then use this welder to break it down into scrap metal
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931375
    m_Localized: That's about it for now. Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931376
    m_Localized: I will be back next week to collect my first payment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931377
    m_Localized: You better have it ready
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931378
    m_Localized: Don't think about calling Security on me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216467931379
    m_Localized: If you do, I will tell them all about your past.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125440
    m_Localized: Good luck, <i>hahaha</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125441
    m_Localized: You will regret this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125442
    m_Localized: Come quietly, scum!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125443
    m_Localized: Do you have my money?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125444
    m_Localized: Pay up or I will expose everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125445
    m_Localized: Good, see you next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125446
    m_Localized: Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125447
    m_Localized: You will regret this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125448
    m_Localized: '[Pay the Blackmailer]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125449
    m_Localized: '[Refuse to pay]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125450
    m_Localized: Hello, I came yesterday
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125451
    m_Localized: Good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125452
    m_Localized: Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125453
    m_Localized: You will regret this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125454
    m_Localized: '[Accept (-{0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125455
    m_Localized: '[Refuse ({0} Rep.)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125456
    m_Localized: I want a refund and compensation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125457
    m_Localized: I want a refund!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125458
    m_Localized: That {0} you sold me really hit the spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125459
    m_Localized: Not sure what was in that {0}, but it made me feel amazing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125460
    m_Localized: That {0} gave me a real buzz.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125461
    m_Localized: I don't know why, but I felt great after using that {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125462
    m_Localized: Whatever was in that {0},
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125463
    m_Localized: That {0} made me feel different in a good way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125464
    m_Localized: The {0} you sold me had quite the kick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125465
    m_Localized: That {0} you sold me really hit the spot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125466
    m_Localized: That {0} gave me a real buzz.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125467
    m_Localized: The {0} you sold me had quite the kick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125468
    m_Localized: I can't stop thinking about that {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125469
    m_Localized: That {0} was smooth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125470
    m_Localized: Your {0} is the only thing keeping me going lately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125471
    m_Localized: That last {0} was stronger than I expected...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125472
    m_Localized: I haven't felt that good in ages since that {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125473
    m_Localized: That {0} really cleared my head for a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125474
    m_Localized: I've been chasing that feeling ever since I had your {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125475
    m_Localized: I'd walk across the station just to get more of that {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125476
    m_Localized: That {0} was exactly the escape I needed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125477
    m_Localized: Got any more of that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125478
    m_Localized: I'll pay good credits if you can get me another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125479
    m_Localized: You wouldn't happen to have more, would you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125480
    m_Localized: If you've got another, I'll take it right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125481
    m_Localized: Please tell me you've still got some.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125482
    m_Localized: Don't hold out on me, got another?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125483
    m_Localized: Where can I get more like that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125484
    m_Localized: That gave me a nice lift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125485
    m_Localized: It was subtle but pleasant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125486
    m_Localized: Really helped take the edge off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125487
    m_Localized: I felt lighter afterwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125488
    m_Localized: Kept me steady through the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125489
    m_Localized: That was seriously strong, hit me all at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125490
    m_Localized: Strongest high I've felt in a long while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125491
    m_Localized: That powerful kick kept me buzzing for hours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125492
    m_Localized: That was the strongest high of my life, nothing even comes close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125493
    m_Localized: I've never felt anything this powerful before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125494
    m_Localized: The intensity had me floating far beyond reality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125495
    m_Localized: Hard to describe what I felt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125496
    m_Localized: It was good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125497
    m_Localized: Hey, I am ready for another expedition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125498
    m_Localized: Got any jobs for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125499
    m_Localized: I'm back from the expedition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125500
    m_Localized: Here's what I found.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125501
    m_Localized: Gotta need a few days to recover.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125502
    m_Localized: Hey dude, do you have any OxyMore Injectors?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125503
    m_Localized: I got some stuff to barter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125504
    m_Localized: I said, I want to barter these for an OxyMore Injector.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125505
    m_Localized: Do you have one or not?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125506
    m_Localized: Ah yes, finally!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
