      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125552
    m_Localized: I will come to collect {0} Dream Dust next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125553
    m_Localized: It must be at least {0}% pure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125554
    m_Localized: Here's some supplies to get you started.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125555
    m_Localized: Don't miss your quota,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125556
    m_Localized: or you will find out what happened to the last guy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125557
    m_Localized: And don't try to run or snitch to Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125558
    m_Localized: We have eyes everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125559
    m_Localized: The Sector 13 Cartel own you now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125560
    m_Localized: Hello Citizen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125561
    m_Localized: Do you have any suspicious activities to report?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125562
    m_Localized: '[Report The Cartel]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125563
    m_Localized: '[Don''t report]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125564
    m_Localized: Oh, I see
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125565
    m_Localized: I see, have a secure shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125566
    m_Localized: Hmmm, hmmm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125567
    m_Localized: I am really disappointed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125568
    m_Localized: I thought we were pretty clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125569
    m_Localized: Listen to me carefully,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125570
    m_Localized: while you are valuable
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125571
    m_Localized: You are not irreplaceable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125572
    m_Localized: Try something like this again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125573
    m_Localized: and you won't get another chance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125574
    m_Localized: Don't miss your quota.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125575
    m_Localized: How the batch coming along?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125576
    m_Localized: You need to cook at least {0} Dream Dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125577
    m_Localized: It must be at least {0}% pure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125578
    m_Localized: Your quota is due next Monday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125579
    m_Localized: '[Ask for more Ingredients ({0} Rep.)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125580
    m_Localized: '[All Good]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125581
    m_Localized: You need more material?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125582
    m_Localized: Sure, take this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125583
    m_Localized: What happened with the stuff I gave you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125584
    m_Localized: It should have been enough
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125585
    m_Localized: Fine, take this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125586
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125587
    m_Localized: Do you have the {0} Dream Dust?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125588
    m_Localized: It must be at least {0}% pure
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125589
    m_Localized: Put them on the counter
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125590
    m_Localized: '[Continue]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125591
    m_Localized: Where is the damn Dream Dust?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125592
    m_Localized: We provided everything you need!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125593
    m_Localized: So be it. Let's take a walk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125594
    m_Localized: You missed your quota.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125595
    m_Localized: You were supposed to deliver {0}!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125596
    m_Localized: Get your shit together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125597
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125598
    m_Localized: Excellent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125599
    m_Localized: Let's check the purity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125600
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125601
    m_Localized: Are you trying to scam the Cartel?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125602
    m_Localized: The average purity is way lower than what we asked
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125603
    m_Localized: '<i>*Pull out a gun*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125604
    m_Localized: This is below what we asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125605
    m_Localized: We will accept it, this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125606
    m_Localized: This is good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125607
    m_Localized: This is much higher than expected.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125608
    m_Localized: Good work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125609
    m_Localized: Alright, for next week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125610
    m_Localized: You need {0} Dream Dust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125611
    m_Localized: And the purity needs to be at least {0}%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125612
    m_Localized: Here's your stipend and some material.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125613
    m_Localized: Don't miss your quota.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125614
    m_Localized: Alright, looks like you've done some good work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125615
    m_Localized: I'll need some time to check the records for your exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125616
    m_Localized: In the meantime, keep cooking.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125617
    m_Localized: About your exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125618
    m_Localized: 'Your debt wasn''t calculated correctly. Interest adds up. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125619
    m_Localized: You've got to cook more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125620
    m_Localized: Alright, looks like you've done some good work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125621
    m_Localized: New policies came down. You got to do more work.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125622
    m_Localized: Bad timing for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125623
    m_Localized: Alright, looks like you've done some good work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125624
    m_Localized: Supplies went missing this week. It's gonna take us some time to sort this out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125625
    m_Localized: Until we balance the books, nobody walks free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125626
    m_Localized: Alright, looks like you've done some good work
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125627
    m_Localized: Dream Dust demand died down anyway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125628
    m_Localized: So everything seems to be in order for your exit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125629
    m_Localized: It's a shame to let you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125630
    m_Localized: Now keep your mouth shut about us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125631
    m_Localized: You won't want to see me again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125632
    m_Localized: Hey dude, you are our cook right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125633
    m_Localized: I just got shot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125634
    m_Localized: You got any meds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125635
    m_Localized: I'll put in a good word for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125636
    m_Localized: Hey, heard you are <i>cookin'</i>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125637
    m_Localized: I got all kind of produce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125638
    m_Localized: Hey, you look like you know your way around chemicals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125639
    m_Localized: I am need some products and I am tired of dealing with middlemen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125640
    m_Localized: I am the one risking to push the products.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125641
    m_Localized: How about you sell some of your stock to me directly?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125642
    m_Localized: 15% off the market price should be good for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125643
    m_Localized: No one needs to know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125644
    m_Localized: I got a chem scanner. Anything that gives a high is good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125645
    m_Localized: Hey, I am back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125646
    m_Localized: You got more products for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125647
    m_Localized: I need 15% off the market price to make a profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125648
    m_Localized: I got a chem scanner. Anything that gives a high is good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125651
    m_Localized: Hello, I've got some water to sell, freshly mined ice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125652
    m_Localized: Back from a mining trip, and I brought you some clean water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125653
    m_Localized: Just hauled some ice, and I've got purified water to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125654
    m_Localized: I've been mining ice asteroids, and this water is top quality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125655
    m_Localized: Freshly melted from asteroid ice. Got good water to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125656
    m_Localized: Take the whole stock, and I'll give you a good deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125657
    m_Localized: Buy all the water, and I'll cut the price for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125658
    m_Localized: Grab the full batch, and I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125659
    m_Localized: If you take it all, I'll offer a discount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125660
    m_Localized: You get a better rate if you buy the whole load.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125661
    m_Localized: Hey, I'm looking to buy some materials for a construction project.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125662
    m_Localized: Got a big job ahead, need to stock up on materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125663
    m_Localized: I'm in charge of a build, and I need supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125664
    m_Localized: I'm here to pick up materials for a construction site.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125665
    m_Localized: Need to buy a lot of construction stuff for a project we're working on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125666
    m_Localized: If you have what I need, we can make a good deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125667
    m_Localized: Show me what you've got, and we can work something out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125668
    m_Localized: Let's see what you have, and maybe we can close a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125669
    m_Localized: I'll take what I need, and we can settle on a fair price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125670
    m_Localized: Hey, just found some stuff while scavenging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125671
    m_Localized: Got a bunch of household items I came across, interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125672
    m_Localized: I've been scavenging, found some things you might like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125673
    m_Localized: Picked up some household junk from the lower levels, wanna see?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125674
    m_Localized: Found some useful items while digging around, thought you'd be interested.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125675
    m_Localized: If you take the whole lot, I'll cut you a good deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125676
    m_Localized: Grab everything and I'll give you a discount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216472125677
    m_Localized: Take all of it, and I'll lower the price for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319744
    m_Localized: Buy the full batch, and I'll make it worth your while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319745
    m_Localized: Take everything off my hands, and I'll give you a bargain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319746
    m_Localized: Water... I need water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319747
    m_Localized: Please, do you have water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319748
    m_Localized: I need to buy water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319749
    m_Localized: I'm low on water...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319750
    m_Localized: Please, I need some water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319751
    m_Localized: I can't spend much, but I'll take whatever I can get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319752
    m_Localized: I don't have a lot of credits, but I'll buy as much as my budget allows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319753
    m_Localized: I'm short on funds, I'll take whatever I can afford.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319754
    m_Localized: I know I can't buy a lot, but anything helps, really.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319755
    m_Localized: My budget's tight, but I'll take whatever you can offer me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319756
    m_Localized: I'm looking for Basewater! Ghostwater is okay too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319757
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319758
    m_Localized: I need a bottle of water, now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319759
    m_Localized: Surely I got enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319760
    m_Localized: I got enough for 1 bottle at least right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319761
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319762
    m_Localized: You got water? My mouth is so dry...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319763
    m_Localized: Basewater, please, or High-Quality.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319764
    m_Localized: That looks good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319765
    m_Localized: Hello, I'm looking to buy some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319766
    m_Localized: Hey, I'm here to pick up some food for the week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319767
    m_Localized: I need some provisions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319768
    m_Localized: Hi there, I'm looking to get some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319769
    m_Localized: I'm here to buy some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319770
    m_Localized: I'll buy what I can with my credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319771
    m_Localized: Let's see how much food I can get within my budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319772
    m_Localized: I'm working with a budget, so I'll take what fits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319773
    m_Localized: Just give me as much as I can afford for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319774
    m_Localized: I'm trying to make my credits stretch, but I'll take what I can get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319775
    m_Localized: Hello, I'm here to restock on medical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319776
    m_Localized: Hey, I need to buy some medical supplies for my pharmacy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319777
    m_Localized: I'm looking to stock up on essential medical items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319778
    m_Localized: Hi, I'm in need of medical supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319779
    m_Localized: I'm here to purchase some medical goods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319780
    m_Localized: Let me see what kind of seeds you have for sale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319781
    m_Localized: Show me what seeds you've got, I need plenty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319782
    m_Localized: I'm here to buy as many seeds as I can get my hands on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319783
    m_Localized: I'll take a good amount of seeds, whatever you've got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319784
    m_Localized: We're taking care of a problem today. Got anything useful?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319785
    m_Localized: A certain someone crossed the line, and we need to send a message.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319786
    m_Localized: Some people think they can cheat the Lower Levels and get away with it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319787
    m_Localized: I need a weapon. Something simple will do
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319788
    m_Localized: Just show me what you've got. Need a weapon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319789
    m_Localized: I need a weapon. I don't need something fancy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319790
    m_Localized: Lights are out everywhere. You still open?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319791
    m_Localized: Blackout hit hard. You still doing business?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319792
    m_Localized: Power's out all over the sector. Figured I'd check here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319793
    m_Localized: Power's going out again, surprise surprise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319794
    m_Localized: I bet there's still power in the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319795
    m_Localized: Looking for some energy cells. Enough to get me through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319796
    m_Localized: Got any energy cell left?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319797
    m_Localized: I'll take any energy cells you have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319798
    m_Localized: Hey, I forgot to stock up for this scheduled maintenance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319799
    m_Localized: Of course I forgot about the scheduled maintenance again...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319800
    m_Localized: You got spare cells? Doesn't have to be full charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319801
    m_Localized: If you've got power cells, I'll take a few off your hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319802
    m_Localized: Need a couple energy cells. Just in case the lights don't come back quick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319803
    m_Localized: This is ridiculous! A power outage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319804
    m_Localized: I had to take the stairs. The *stairs*!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319805
    m_Localized: I can't believe the power's out on the <b>Upper Levels</b>!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319806
    m_Localized: Do you have energy cells? I'll pay whatever you want.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319807
    m_Localized: Gimme some energy cells, I got plenty of credit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319808
    m_Localized: This blackout is driving people crazy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319809
    m_Localized: They smashed up the place down the corridor. I'm next, I know it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319810
    m_Localized: I've got a store to protect and I am not counting on Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319811
    m_Localized: It's getting bad out there, real bad. I need to be ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319812
    m_Localized: Got anything that'll scare off looters? Even a pipe'll do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319813
    m_Localized: You got any weapons? I'll take anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319814
    m_Localized: Anything solid, loud, or sharp. I'll take what I can get.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319815
    m_Localized: There's a serious Oxymore Overdose problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319816
    m_Localized: I got some free Naloxgone to help out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319817
    m_Localized: Can I trust you to give them to those in need?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319818
    m_Localized: I just came from the Docks...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319819
    m_Localized: A shipment of counterfeit cigarettes just got unloaded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319820
    m_Localized: You might start seeing them in circulation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319821
    m_Localized: I brought you some stuff to help identify fakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319822
    m_Localized: Use the Magnifying Glass on the Cigarette Box to Examine it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319823
    m_Localized: Use the Handbook as reference.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319824
    m_Localized: If you find any discrepancies, you can confront the customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319825
    m_Localized: A single discrepancy is enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319826
    m_Localized: If you're correct, they will lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319827
    m_Localized: Falsely accuse someone, and you'll lose reputation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319828
    m_Localized: Good luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319829
    m_Localized: Hey, you're the newbie, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319830
    m_Localized: I am with the <b>Lower Levels Janitorial Staff</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319831
    m_Localized: Since you are new
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319832
    m_Localized: Let me tell you how things work here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319833
    m_Localized: You are <b>NOT</b> allowed to clean the storefront.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319834
    m_Localized: If you want your storefront cleaned...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319835
    m_Localized: You gotta <u>pay the fees</u>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319836
    m_Localized: And, if you decide to clean the storefront on your own...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319837
    m_Localized: We will make you regret it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319838
    m_Localized: See you around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319839
    m_Localized: Hey, looks like you're still around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319840
    m_Localized: I'm going to let you in on a little secret.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319841
    m_Localized: The janitorial staff runs a little side business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319842
    m_Localized: We operate the Underground Exchange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319843
    m_Localized: How it works is, you can drop specific items in the trash can—
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319844
    m_Localized: —use the janitorial service—
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319845
    m_Localized: —and we'll leave you something in return in the morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319846
    m_Localized: Here's the list. Some of it changes every few days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319847
    m_Localized: Best part about the Underground Exchange?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319848
    m_Localized: You won't be tracked by Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319849
    m_Localized: See you around, kid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319850
    m_Localized: Hey, per our previous agreement
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319851
    m_Localized: You are now part of the Exchange.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319852
    m_Localized: Here's the list. Some of it changes every few days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319853
    m_Localized: You drop the requested items in the trash can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319854
    m_Localized: Then, you use the janitorial service
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319855
    m_Localized: And we'll leave you something in return in the morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319856
    m_Localized: Remember, the Underground Exchange
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319857
    m_Localized: It isn't tracked by Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319858
    m_Localized: Welcome to our network.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319859
    m_Localized: Hello! <wave a=0.25>Welcome to our little neighborhood!</wave>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319860
    m_Localized: My name is <slide a=0.25> Joe Wild! </slide>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319861
    m_Localized: As you might already know...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319862
    m_Localized: This sector, though charming, is not the safest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319863
    m_Localized: Even among the Lower Levels...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319864
    m_Localized: That's why I run an <i>insurance service!</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319865
    m_Localized: —for small business owners such like yourself—
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319866
    m_Localized: It is a daily subscription service—
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319867
    m_Localized: —to insure all of your goods in case of theft!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319868
    m_Localized: You can opt in or out of the service before you sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319869
    m_Localized: Anyways that's all from me. Good luck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319870
    m_Localized: Me again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319871
    m_Localized: Looks like your business is doing well!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319872
    m_Localized: You know, down here...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319873
    m_Localized: It's all about who you know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319874
    m_Localized: For the right price, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319875
    m_Localized: I can introduce you to my contacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319876
    m_Localized: Suppliers, Informants, even Security Officers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319877
    m_Localized: Here is what I can do for you...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319878
    m_Localized: Hello!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319879
    m_Localized: Hope you're doing well!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319880
    m_Localized: Anyway, I don't know if you noticed,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319881
    m_Localized: but I can get you access to the public Marketplace Request system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319882
    m_Localized: You can directly fulfill requests from station residents,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319883
    m_Localized: and I highly recommend it for a business owner like you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319884
    m_Localized: Wanna take a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319885
    m_Localized: Don't forget you can call me anytime if you need help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319886
    m_Localized: Do you buy food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319887
    m_Localized: I got some extra to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319888
    m_Localized: Do you guys have food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319889
    m_Localized: I need to stock up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319890
    m_Localized: Hello. I am Officer Lun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319891
    m_Localized: I'm with the Security Department.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319892
    m_Localized: As per standard...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319893
    m_Localized: You have an alarm button under your counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319894
    m_Localized: Here's a list of the current wanted criminals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319895
    m_Localized: If one of them comes to your store,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319896
    m_Localized: '<u><b>Do NOT listen to them!</u></b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319897
    m_Localized: Notify us with your alarm before they leave.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319898
    m_Localized: We will take care of the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319899
    m_Localized: Only report them if you're sure it's them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319900
    m_Localized: You will be fined if you make false report.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319901
    m_Localized: Have a secure shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319902
    m_Localized: It's Officer Lun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319903
    m_Localized: I hope you've been checking that Wanted list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319904
    m_Localized: I have new instructions for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319905
    m_Localized: '<u><b>Report all sellers carrying mid-level Contraband, or higher.</u></b>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319906
    m_Localized: Low level contraband sellers are not worth our time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319907
    m_Localized: Your reputation might take a hit...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319908
    m_Localized: But we will reward you base on how much contraband we seize.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319909
    m_Localized: Have a secure shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319910
    m_Localized: I found a crate of PEAT yesterday!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319911
    m_Localized: I'll take 15% off if you take them all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319912
    m_Localized: Hey there, I got a ton of scrap metals!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319913
    m_Localized: Interested? 33% off if you take it all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319914
    m_Localized: If you *do* take them...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319915
    m_Localized: You should probably buy a furnace.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319916
    m_Localized: You could melt this stuff into metal ingots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319917
    m_Localized: You'd make a pretty profit, too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319918
    m_Localized: '''Sup.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319919
    m_Localized: Got some genuine Hemingway Cigarettes here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319920
    m_Localized: Interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319921
    m_Localized: Hey!! Look what I found!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319922
    m_Localized: It is still sealed and all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319923
    m_Localized: Must be worth a lot right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319924
    m_Localized: Hello, I'm a member of the Appraiser Board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319925
    m_Localized: Certain items that have complex pricing structure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319926
    m_Localized: We help customers determine the exact value.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319927
    m_Localized: Anyways, I heard you just moved in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319928
    m_Localized: Your store could offer appraisal services.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319929
    m_Localized: It will be an additional source of income for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319930
    m_Localized: Are you interested to join the board as an Appraiser?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319931
    m_Localized: Entry fee is {0} Credits only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319932
    m_Localized: '[Join the board ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319933
    m_Localized: '[Don''t join]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319934
    m_Localized: '[Ask them to come back later]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319935
    m_Localized: Great! Welcome to the board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319936
    m_Localized: Here's the training material.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319937
    m_Localized: We will start sending customers your way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319938
    m_Localized: I'll be back in a few days to check on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319939
    m_Localized: Shame, I know quality when I see it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319940
    m_Localized: Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319941
    m_Localized: Sure, I'll be back in a few days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319942
    m_Localized: Hi again, I am from the Appraiser Board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319943
    m_Localized: I was here a few days ago.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319944
    m_Localized: So? Have you made up your mind?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319945
    m_Localized: I'll be back in a few days to check with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319946
    m_Localized: Hey there, I got a pack of *genuine* Hemingway Cigarettes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319947
    m_Localized: You buyin'?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319948
    m_Localized: Hey there, I got some extra water to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319949
    m_Localized: Want to buy? It's Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319950
    m_Localized: Hey, got Basewater?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319951
    m_Localized: I am heading out for a scav run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319952
    m_Localized: No, I want Basewater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319953
    m_Localized: Yeah, that's the stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319954
    m_Localized: I'd like to buy some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319955
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319956
    m_Localized: Hey, you got any snacks or treats?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319957
    m_Localized: Chips, candy or chocolate?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319958
    m_Localized: Or cigarettes... I'd take cigarettes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319959
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319960
    m_Localized: Hey, got any beer?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319961
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits to spend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319962
    m_Localized: You got food, or beverages?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319963
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319964
    m_Localized: I want variety, if you've got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319965
    m_Localized: So I am not buying two of the same item.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319966
    m_Localized: But I am willing to pay more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319967
    m_Localized: Hello, I am from the First Bank on the Upper Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319968
    m_Localized: I just want to let you know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319969
    m_Localized: that your building has been listed for sale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319970
    m_Localized: and we might be interested to help you buy it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319971
    m_Localized: The building is listed at 40000 Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319972
    m_Localized: But with our mortgage, you will be able to afford it sooner
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319973
    m_Localized: I will return to give you more detail
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319974
    m_Localized: once you have more cash on hand for the down payment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319975
    m_Localized: Hello, I am from the First Bank on the Upper Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319976
    m_Localized: According to our research,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319977
    m_Localized: you are running a successful business here
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319978
    m_Localized: and your landlord has listed your building for sale
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319979
    m_Localized: At 40000 Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216476319980
    m_Localized: We are ready to offer you a mortgage to assist you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514048
    m_Localized: If you are interested in buying your building.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514049
    m_Localized: Here are the details.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514050
    m_Localized: Take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514051
    m_Localized: Due to the risk of lending money in the Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514052
    m_Localized: we require 20% as down payment at 8000 Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514053
    m_Localized: Your yearly interest rate is 75%.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514054
    m_Localized: Hello, I am the loan clerk from the First Bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514055
    m_Localized: we spoke last week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514056
    m_Localized: Are you now interested to buy your building
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514057
    m_Localized: and take out a mortgage with us?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514058
    m_Localized: Hello! You must be new.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514059
    m_Localized: Salutations, you can call me Dr. Jackson.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514060
    m_Localized: I used to deal with the previous tenant of this shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514061
    m_Localized: Until he got arrested!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514062
    m_Localized: Anyhow, I make all kinds of gadgets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514063
    m_Localized: Gadgets which could help you run your store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514064
    m_Localized: '<u>Most of my machines work overnight.</u>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514065
    m_Localized: '<u>They also require a dedicated Energy Cell.</u>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514066
    m_Localized: Since you are a new customer...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514067
    m_Localized: I will give you a special discount on your first purchase.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514068
    m_Localized: This furnace turns scrap metal and ore into valuable ingots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514069
    m_Localized: It's a deal!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514070
    m_Localized: Here's a little gift for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514071
    m_Localized: Come visit me at my shop sometime, after you close for the day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514072
    m_Localized: I buy all kinds of Materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514073
    m_Localized: And you can check out my new inventions!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514074
    m_Localized: See you around!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514075
    m_Localized: Hello! Check these out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514076
    m_Localized: You can install modules inside certain machines.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514077
    m_Localized: It can improve their performance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514078
    m_Localized: Interested? I'll give you a special "friend of science" discount, just once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514079
    m_Localized: Good!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514080
    m_Localized: Remember, you can always come visit me at my shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514081
    m_Localized: After you close for the day, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514082
    m_Localized: See you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514083
    m_Localized: One of my contacts in Security gave me this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514084
    m_Localized: If Security suspects you committing too many crimes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514085
    m_Localized: They will launch an investigation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514086
    m_Localized: Once they have enough proof, they will enforce your sentence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514087
    m_Localized: If you've committed a crime, it's best to keep a low profile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514088
    m_Localized: Until the heat is off, at least.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514089
    m_Localized: And, please, watch who you deal with when trading Contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514090
    m_Localized: some will blabber more than others.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514091
    m_Localized: Listen, just a heads up...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514092
    m_Localized: The trade board will soon require everyone to have a trading permit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514093
    m_Localized: From what I hear, they will start selling permits in two weeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514094
    m_Localized: A permit should cost around {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514095
    m_Localized: Enforcement starts a week after that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514096
    m_Localized: If you can't get enough credit by then...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514097
    m_Localized: Perhaps you can come up with some kind of arrangement with them?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514098
    m_Localized: The trade board can be quite <i>flexible</i>...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514099
    m_Localized: If you are buying a permit, though...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514100
    m_Localized: Make sure you still have enough for rent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514101
    m_Localized: Hey there, I found some ruined machines
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514102
    m_Localized: If you have the tools, like a welder or screwdriver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514103
    m_Localized: you can probably salvage it for parts
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514104
    m_Localized: You can make a pretty profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514105
    m_Localized: Hello, You got any spare Electronic Parts by chance?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514106
    m_Localized: There's no more in Engineering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514107
    m_Localized: And it's harder and harder to find them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514108
    m_Localized: We are not getting enough from visiting ships
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514109
    m_Localized: If nothing change,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514110
    m_Localized: this station will fall apart one day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514111
    m_Localized: Anyways, I'll take some Materials and Modules too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514112
    m_Localized: You got Dream Dust or Oxymore?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514113
    m_Localized: I got a long expedition ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514114
    m_Localized: We will be heading out to the asteroid belt again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514115
    m_Localized: Working 12 hours shifts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514116
    m_Localized: Need something to help me get through it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514117
    m_Localized: '*Walk swiftly to the storefront*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514118
    m_Localized: I have a bunch of meds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514119
    m_Localized: Need to sell them all. Today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514120
    m_Localized: 33% off if you take the lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514121
    m_Localized: My clinic asked me to get medical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514122
    m_Localized: The clinic is swamped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514123
    m_Localized: The staff is working 24/7.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514124
    m_Localized: We rely only on donations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514125
    m_Localized: and there's never enough meds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514126
    m_Localized: there's not much we can do without it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514127
    m_Localized: I'll take everything, even the homemade stuffs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514128
    m_Localized: '<i>*COUGH*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514129
    m_Localized: Hello, do you have High-Quality Water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514130
    m_Localized: Clinic said I've been drinking too much bad water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514131
    m_Localized: And I need to drink High-Quality Water for a month.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514132
    m_Localized: Else, I won't get better...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514133
    m_Localized: But damn that stuff is expensive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514134
    m_Localized: Yeah, I'll take that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514135
    m_Localized: Hey, I just got back from a scav run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514136
    m_Localized: There's less and less to find on the Station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514137
    m_Localized: Anything not behind locks in the Abandoned Sections is picked clean.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514138
    m_Localized: I heard stories about scavs turning on others down there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514139
    m_Localized: and coming back to sell off their looted gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514140
    m_Localized: It's safer in the Dumping Grounds,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514141
    m_Localized: but it's hard to find anything worth the time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514142
    m_Localized: Anyway, take a look at my stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514143
    m_Localized: 25% off if you take the lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514144
    m_Localized: Hey, you got any snacks or treats?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514145
    m_Localized: Or caffeine pills or cigarette?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514146
    m_Localized: It's another day patrolling the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514147
    m_Localized: Feels like I can get shanked anytime here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514148
    m_Localized: Can't wait until they promote me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514149
    m_Localized: And assign me to the Upper Levels,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514150
    m_Localized: Or the Mid Levels at least...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514151
    m_Localized: Hey! Do you have any meds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514152
    m_Localized: I need them now, I've been shot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514153
    m_Localized: I can't go to the clinic, it's too risky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514154
    m_Localized: Some gang members invaded our turf,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514155
    m_Localized: trying to push their product.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514156
    m_Localized: We're not about to let that happen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514157
    m_Localized: Hello shopkeep!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514158
    m_Localized: I am visiting the Lower Levels
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514159
    m_Localized: Wanted to experience life down here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514160
    m_Localized: I must say, the Lower Level's culture is truly charming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514161
    m_Localized: Up there, it gets pretty boring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514162
    m_Localized: Same people doing the same thing over and over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514163
    m_Localized: I am looking to buy souvenirs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514164
    m_Localized: Anything typical of The Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514165
    m_Localized: Makeshift goods, processed food you eat, low-tech weapon you use
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514166
    m_Localized: the good stuff you take for fun. *Wink*
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514167
    m_Localized: I want to have variety and willing to pay more for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514168
    m_Localized: Hey there, You got weapons, ammo or armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514169
    m_Localized: You are new right? Didn't see you before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514170
    m_Localized: I am a security consultant for small businesses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514171
    m_Localized: You should get a security alarm if you don't already have one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514172
    m_Localized: There's more gangs and organized crimes in the Lowers' nowadays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514173
    m_Localized: I bet someone already tried selling you <i>"insurance"</i>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514174
    m_Localized: Anyway, you got the stuff?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514175
    m_Localized: Hiya there, got food and water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514176
    m_Localized: I am gonna be here all day doing the repairs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514177
    m_Localized: Some crazy scavenger salvaged
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514178
    m_Localized: the metal plating off a structural beam again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514179
    m_Localized: I bet next, they will start stripping
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514180
    m_Localized: copper wires from the life support system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514181
    m_Localized: '<i>*Sigh*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514182
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514183
    m_Localized: Hey, I am back from a salvage run around the Station
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514184
    m_Localized: The debris and the trade ship derelicts are a gold mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514185
    m_Localized: Investing in that salvage ship was the best decision I made.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514186
    m_Localized: While the scavs are pushing each other for junks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514187
    m_Localized: in the Abandoned Sections.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514188
    m_Localized: I am out there with my ship, chilling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514189
    m_Localized: '<i>*SHIVERS*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514190
    m_Localized: Hey, I am not doing so good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514191
    m_Localized: I need some meds, but I don't have much credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514192
    m_Localized: I tried getting help at the Lower Levels Clinic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514193
    m_Localized: But the line are so long,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514194
    m_Localized: I can't even see the door...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514195
    m_Localized: I know that they are a charity,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514196
    m_Localized: But it's just not enough for all of the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514197
    m_Localized: Hello
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514198
    m_Localized: Do you sell food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514199
    m_Localized: There's been a burglary at my home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514200
    m_Localized: All my food is gone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514201
    m_Localized: I suspect it's my neighbors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514202
    m_Localized: They are poor and I don't blame them
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514203
    m_Localized: There's barely any jobs aside scavenging and criminal activities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514204
    m_Localized: Hello, I got these to sell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514205
    m_Localized: It was my weapon during the Second Revolution
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514206
    m_Localized: I have no use for it anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514207
    m_Localized: I kept it all those years
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514208
    m_Localized: hoping there would be another revolution I could join.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514209
    m_Localized: But it never came and I am too old for this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514210
    m_Localized: You were a Lower Level revolutionary?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514211
    m_Localized: Yes, a squad leader.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514212
    m_Localized: We thought that we had a real chance to make changes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514213
    m_Localized: The truth is that we were way over our head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514214
    m_Localized: Just like the First Revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514215
    m_Localized: Anyway, if you take it,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514216
    m_Localized: I will be willing to buy some food, drinks and household items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514217
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514218
    m_Localized: Please, It's urgent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514219
    m_Localized: I need a variety of tools, weapons and meds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514220
    m_Localized: My girlfriend went on a scav run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514221
    m_Localized: She went to the Abandoned Sections.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216480514222
    m_Localized: Hasn't come back since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096960
    m_Localized: I'm worried something happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096961
    m_Localized: I told her that place wasn't worth the risk,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096962
    m_Localized: but she wouldn't listen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096963
    m_Localized: I have to find her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096964
    m_Localized: You there, I got some fresh Nutrifruits to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096965
    m_Localized: They are easier to grow, resistant to pest and diseases.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096966
    m_Localized: I just wish the damn seeds weren't that expensive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096967
    m_Localized: Why did they have to make these plants seedless?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096968
    m_Localized: Hey, you got any food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096969
    m_Localized: It's been ages since I came down here to the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096970
    m_Localized: I moved up after I got lucky and won that Lottery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096971
    m_Localized: They started the Lower Levels Lottery a while back,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096972
    m_Localized: Right after the Second Revolution ended, actually.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096973
    m_Localized: Still, sometimes I miss the cheap, comforting food down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096974
    m_Localized: Hey, I found a whole box of PEAT!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096975
    m_Localized: You ever wonder what this meat is made out of?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096976
    m_Localized: Most people think it's meat from commercial pig breed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096977
    m_Localized: Some folks say it's vat-grown protein.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096978
    m_Localized: Me? I think it could be insects.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096979
    m_Localized: Anyways, you want to buy some?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096980
    m_Localized: Hello, how are you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096981
    m_Localized: Did you know that Station Command are actually aliens?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096982
    m_Localized: This whole Station is a social experiment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096983
    m_Localized: Studying us before they invade the rest of the Republic
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096984
    m_Localized: How convenient that the rest of The Republic is so far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096985
    m_Localized: All of Security are androids!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096986
    m_Localized: Sentinel Collapse Disorder is a purposefully designed condition!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096987
    m_Localized: The Revolution was originally founded by Command!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096988
    m_Localized: I got some real protection against the aliens, want some?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096989
    m_Localized: Don't worry, I made them myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096990
    m_Localized: Also, you got anything good?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096991
    m_Localized: Preferably Dream Dust?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096992
    m_Localized: Hello. My employers sent me to acquire supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096993
    m_Localized: I still can't believe they're going through with this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096994
    m_Localized: They're hosting a "Scav" party.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096995
    m_Localized: Guests from the Upper Levels Elite are dressing up as Scavs,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096996
    m_Localized: eating Lower Level food from tin trays.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096997
    m_Localized: There's a contest for the most "authentic" outfit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096998
    m_Localized: Judged by people who have never lived like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493096999
    m_Localized: Is that supposed to be funny?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097000
    m_Localized: Hello, I got some hazardous waste to dispose of.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097001
    m_Localized: Proper disposal is expensive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097002
    m_Localized: I'll pay you 100 Credits per barrel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097003
    m_Localized: '[Take 1 barrel]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097004
    m_Localized: '[Take 3 barrels]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097005
    m_Localized: '[Take 5 barrels]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097006
    m_Localized: Hey, I got a custom gun order.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097007
    m_Localized: Need a custom firearm, can you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097008
    m_Localized: Looking to order a modified gun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097009
    m_Localized: Got a gun request for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097010
    m_Localized: Want something custom-built.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216493097011
    m_Localized: Selling a few pieces, decent shape.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291264
    m_Localized: You buy guns? Got a good one here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291265
    m_Localized: Found something that still shoots. Interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291266
    m_Localized: Clearing out gear, got mods and mags.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291267
    m_Localized: Need cash, here's my backup piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291268
    m_Localized: This thing saved me once. you want it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291269
    m_Localized: Hello, I have information that might interest you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291270
    m_Localized: But it's not for free
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291271
    m_Localized: Good choice
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291272
    m_Localized: Listen up,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291273
    m_Localized: word on the street is that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291274
    m_Localized: in 3 days, one of the large Nutrifruit farm is going to harvest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291275
    m_Localized: All food market price will crash for a few days afterward
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291276
    m_Localized: That's it, see you around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291277
    m_Localized: Hello, I have some privileged information,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291278
    m_Localized: Hey there, I've got some insider info for you,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291279
    m_Localized: Hey. I've stumbled upon some valuable information,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291280
    m_Localized: that might be of interest to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291281
    m_Localized: that could be worth your while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291282
    m_Localized: that you might want to hear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291283
    m_Localized: that could change your game.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291284
    m_Localized: But it's not for free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291285
    m_Localized: However, it'll cost you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291286
    m_Localized: But I'm gonna need some credits for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291287
    m_Localized: Just know, this comes at a price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291288
    m_Localized: Enjoy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291289
    m_Localized: Well, well, well. Look who we have here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291290
    m_Localized: We are sick and tired of your craps.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291291
    m_Localized: We are here to get rid of you once and for all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291292
    m_Localized: GET THEM!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291293
    m_Localized: Hello Shopkeeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291294
    m_Localized: For your crimes against the station
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291295
    m_Localized: You are under arrest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291296
    m_Localized: The Upper Levels send their regards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291298
    m_Localized: Just liberated some supplies from the oppressors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291299
    m_Localized: Better in your hands than rotting in theirs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291300
    m_Localized: All proceeds go back into the revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291301
    m_Localized: Hello, We have some stock for sale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291302
    m_Localized: Everything here is from our people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291303
    m_Localized: All the profits go to the revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291305
    m_Localized: '<i>*Pull out a gun*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291306
    m_Localized: Please tell me you got some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291307
    m_Localized: I just checked 2 other shops but they are all out of stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291308
    m_Localized: Hey you got any food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291309
    m_Localized: Food prices are getting crazy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291310
    m_Localized: Do you have any medicine left?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291311
    m_Localized: Every shop I tried is sold out!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291312
    m_Localized: Looking for some medical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291313
    m_Localized: Prices are getting unbearable lately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291314
    m_Localized: Got anything to take the edge off?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291315
    m_Localized: Supply's dried up everywhere, I'm desperate!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291316
    m_Localized: You got anything to help relax?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291317
    m_Localized: Prices keep climbing, but I'll pay what I can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291318
    m_Localized: I need protection, anything you've got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291319
    m_Localized: Shops are cleaned out and trouble's coming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291320
    m_Localized: Looking for weapons or armor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291321
    m_Localized: Things are getting tense, better be ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291322
    m_Localized: Got any scrap or raw material?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291323
    m_Localized: Workshops are shutting down, nobody can find stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291324
    m_Localized: Looking for materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291325
    m_Localized: Prices are going wild lately, everyone's hoarding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291326
    m_Localized: '<i>*Radio Chatter*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291327
    m_Localized: Hmmm, somehow our evidence on you just got lost.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291328
    m_Localized: I don't know what you did, but we will get you one day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291329
    m_Localized: Hello, We have evidence against you on multiple counts of crimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291330
    m_Localized: Including {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291331
    m_Localized: You must paid a fine of {0} Credit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291332
    m_Localized: Otherwise you will be arrested immediately
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291333
    m_Localized: '[Pay The Fine ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291334
    m_Localized: Good. Stay out of trouble
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291335
    m_Localized: '[Don''t Pay The Fine]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291336
    m_Localized: Then you are under arrest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291337
    m_Localized: You have the right to remain silent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291338
    m_Localized: Freeze! You are under arrest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291339
    m_Localized: for {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291340
    m_Localized: You will be jailed for a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291341
    m_Localized: You have the right to remain silent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291342
    m_Localized: Hands in the air! You are under arrest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291343
    m_Localized: for {0}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291344
    m_Localized: You will be executed for your crimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291345
    m_Localized: Hello, in light of your recent activities
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291346
    m_Localized: your permit is hereby revoked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291347
    m_Localized: Have a secure shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291348
    m_Localized: Good choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291349
    m_Localized: Smart move.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291350
    m_Localized: You made the right call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291352
    m_Localized: Listen up,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291353
    m_Localized: In {0} days, a major Nutrifruit farm will begin its harvest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291354
    m_Localized: In {0} days, a big Nutrifruit farm will begin to harvest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291355
    m_Localized: In {0} days, a large Nutrifruit farm will start harvesting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291357
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit will be plentiful, and prices will drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291358
    m_Localized: Expect plenty of Nutrifruit, and prices are gonna dip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291359
    m_Localized: Get ready for a flood of Nutrifruit, and prices will lower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291361
    m_Localized: The food market will drop for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291362
    m_Localized: Food prices are gonna fall for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291363
    m_Localized: That means food prices will stay low for about {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291365
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291366
    m_Localized: Listen closely,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291367
    m_Localized: In {0} days, a significant lower-level Nutrifruit farm is going to suffer a bad harvest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291368
    m_Localized: And the food prices will rise for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291369
    m_Localized: Alright, you got what you paid for.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291370
    m_Localized: Fine, listen up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291371
    m_Localized: You didn't hear this from me, okay?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291373
    m_Localized: Here's the scoop,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291374
    m_Localized: In {0} days, there's going to be a shortage of meds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291375
    m_Localized: Word is, in {0} days, the station's gonna be running low on meds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291376
    m_Localized: Supplies are drying up, and in {0} days, it's gonna hit hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291378
    m_Localized: Prices will go through the roof for {0} days, so act fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291379
    m_Localized: After that, medical prices are going to spike for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291380
    m_Localized: Medical stuff will be scarce, and prices will rise for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291382
    m_Localized: You wouldn't believe what happened...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291383
    m_Localized: Got a juicy tip for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291384
    m_Localized: Listen, this one's fresh.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291385
    m_Localized: Here's something that just came up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291386
    m_Localized: Some folks stumbled on a hidden storeroom, packed with household items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291387
    m_Localized: While scavenging, they found a hidden room full of household goods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291388
    m_Localized: A hidden storeroom was uncovered during some scavenging runs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291389
    m_Localized: A hidden storeroom was just found, full of household items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291390
    m_Localized: That means the market's going to be flooded with goods, so prices will drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291391
    m_Localized: You can expect a lot of cheap household items on the market soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291392
    m_Localized: With all that stock, household prices are going to fall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291393
    m_Localized: A surplus of household goods means prices will dip.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291394
    m_Localized: this news will hit the market tomorrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291395
    m_Localized: This'll last for about {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291396
    m_Localized: Get in quick, it'll be a bargain for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291397
    m_Localized: The market will be low for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291398
    m_Localized: Prices should stay down for around {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291399
    m_Localized: Got some fresh news for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291400
    m_Localized: Here's a hot one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291401
    m_Localized: Listen up, you might like this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291402
    m_Localized: A group of miners is coming back from a rich asteroid
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291403
    m_Localized: Miners are coming back from a successful expedition
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291404
    m_Localized: Word on the street is the miners struck gold or rather, minerals.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291405
    m_Localized: A mining crew is bringing back a lot of materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291406
    m_Localized: That means material prices will drop for a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291407
    m_Localized: With so much supply, materials are going to be cheap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291408
    m_Localized: Expect a dip in material prices due to this influx.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291409
    m_Localized: Material prices are about to fall thanks to their haul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291410
    m_Localized: They are coming back in {0} days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291411
    m_Localized: It'll last for about {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291412
    m_Localized: Better move fast, this will only last {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291413
    m_Localized: Prices will stay down for the next {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291414
    m_Localized: You've got around {0} days to take advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291415
    m_Localized: Listen up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291416
    m_Localized: In {0} days, the water treatment plant will break down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291417
    m_Localized: Water will be in short supply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291418
    m_Localized: Prices are gonna spike.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291419
    m_Localized: Expect this to last for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291420
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291421
    m_Localized: In {0} days, miners will return with ice water. You catch my drift?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291422
    m_Localized: Expect a flood of supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291423
    m_Localized: Prices are going to drop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 420216497291424
    m_Localized: This should last for {0} days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902084
    m_Localized: I stumbled upon these.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902085
    m_Localized: I found these.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902086
    m_Localized: I've got these.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902087
    m_Localized: Check out these stuff I came across.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902088
    m_Localized: I picked up some stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902089
    m_Localized: Could you check their value for me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902090
    m_Localized: Can you tell me how much they're worth?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902091
    m_Localized: I'm curious about their price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902092
    m_Localized: What's the going rate for these?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902093
    m_Localized: Any idea how much these are worth?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902094
    m_Localized: Good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902095
    m_Localized: Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902096
    m_Localized: Alright.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902097
    m_Localized: Done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902098
    m_Localized: Great.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902099
    m_Localized: Fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902100
    m_Localized: Got it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902101
    m_Localized: Perfect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902102
    m_Localized: Sure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902103
    m_Localized: Settled.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902104
    m_Localized: I'm off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902105
    m_Localized: That's all I need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902106
    m_Localized: See you next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902107
    m_Localized: Pleasure doing business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902108
    m_Localized: Thanks, bye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902109
    m_Localized: Catch you later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902110
    m_Localized: We're done here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302697902111
    m_Localized: Have a good one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096384
    m_Localized: I'll be back soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096385
    m_Localized: Have a nice day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096386
    m_Localized: Alright, I'm out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096387
    m_Localized: Thanks, see you around.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096388
    m_Localized: Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096389
    m_Localized: That wraps it up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096390
    m_Localized: This is out of my budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096391
    m_Localized: This is out of my budget, I got {0} Credits left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096392
    m_Localized: I bought one of these already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096393
    m_Localized: I am not buying Contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096395
    m_Localized: Alright, I think I am all done
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096396
    m_Localized: Goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096397
    m_Localized: Wait, I am not done yet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096398
    m_Localized: '<i>*Banging On The Shutter Door*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096399
    m_Localized: How rude!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096400
    m_Localized: Woah, what are you doing?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096401
    m_Localized: Anything else you want to buy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096402
    m_Localized: Is that all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096403
    m_Localized: Was there anything else?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096404
    m_Localized: I've been watching, you're doing well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096405
    m_Localized: Once you close the shop for the day...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096406
    m_Localized: You should have time to go outside before going to sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096407
    m_Localized: You still remember the way to the Dumping Grounds right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096408
    m_Localized: Hey, just dropping by to see your first day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096409
    m_Localized: Looks like you are all set.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096410
    m_Localized: Listen, I got this for you
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096411
    m_Localized: '*He pulls some notes from his jacket pocket and places them on the counter.*'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096412
    m_Localized: Just some things I wouldn't want you to forget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096413
    m_Localized: Remember to keep both sides of the counter clear, ok?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096414
    m_Localized: So the customers have space for the stuff they want to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096415
    m_Localized: And don't leave anything on the outside counter overnight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096416
    m_Localized: Unless you want it to get stolen, that is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096417
    m_Localized: Good luck, Rookie. I'll be watching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096418
    m_Localized: Thanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096419
    m_Localized: Hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096420
    m_Localized: I've got some useful information for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096421
    m_Localized: Word is that a mining expedition is coming back tomorrow...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096422
    m_Localized: So the market will be flush with Materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096423
    m_Localized: Prices will fall, for a while, while supply outweighs demand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096424
    m_Localized: Try to take advantage of this information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096425
    m_Localized: I have arranged a daily Newspaper delivery for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096443
    m_Localized: You are all clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096444
    m_Localized: Thank you for your cooperation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096445
    m_Localized: I found low level contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096446
    m_Localized: I'll let you off with a warning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096447
    m_Localized: Don't let me see that again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096448
    m_Localized: Looks like there's some contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096449
    m_Localized: They will be seized.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096450
    m_Localized: Have a secure shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096451
    m_Localized: Looks like there's some stolen items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096452
    m_Localized: That is contraband!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096453
    m_Localized: Step aside, I will be conducting an full inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096454
    m_Localized: That is stolen!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096455
    m_Localized: Open your cargo hold and step aside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096456
    m_Localized: '[Accept Inspection.]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096457
    m_Localized: '[Offer Bribe. ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096458
    m_Localized: I suppose I will look away this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096459
    m_Localized: We found some contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096460
    m_Localized: You will be fined {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096461
    m_Localized: I don't have enough Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096462
    m_Localized: Then you are under arrest!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096463
    m_Localized: They will be seized
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096464
    m_Localized: And you must pay the {0} Credits fine. Now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096465
    m_Localized: '[Pays the fine]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096466
    m_Localized: Thank you for your cooperation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096467
    m_Localized: What is this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096468
    m_Localized: You are under arrest for possession of Contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096469
    m_Localized: I would have you arrested for this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096470
    m_Localized: But looks like you have friends in high places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096471
    m_Localized: Next time you won't be so lucky.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096472
    m_Localized: Keep it low profile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096473
    m_Localized: We tolerate it, doesn't make it legal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096474
    m_Localized: Why would you show that to me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096475
    m_Localized: Woah! What's going on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096476
    m_Localized: Is this some kind of mistake?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096477
    m_Localized: Wait, what did I do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096478
    m_Localized: Hey, what's the meaning of this?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096479
    m_Localized: Didn't do nothin'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096480
    m_Localized: You got the wrong guy, I swear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096481
    m_Localized: Hey, easy! I ain't resisting!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096482
    m_Localized: Damn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096483
    m_Localized: You snitch!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096484
    m_Localized: Was just trying to make a few creds...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096485
    m_Localized: WOAH! What's going on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096486
    m_Localized: SHIT!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096487
    m_Localized: YOU SNITCH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096488
    m_Localized: I AM INNOCENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096489
    m_Localized: YOU SNITCH! I'LL GET YOU.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096490
    m_Localized: DON'T SHOOT.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096491
    m_Localized: You need to come with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096492
    m_Localized: Stay calm and follow us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096493
    m_Localized: You're under investigation. Come quietly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096494
    m_Localized: Don't make this harder than it has to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096495
    m_Localized: Just cooperate, and this will be over soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096496
    m_Localized: We have some questions for you. Let's go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096497
    m_Localized: Hmm?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096498
    m_Localized: Let me explain something to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096499
    m_Localized: This little sector of ours is an ecosystem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096500
    m_Localized: Take too much without giving anything back...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096501
    m_Localized: The balance is broken and everything collapses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096502
    m_Localized: I am willing to do you some favors and, in return...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096503
    m_Localized: You look out for the Lower Levels from time to time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096504
    m_Localized: Here's my card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096505
    m_Localized: Give me a call if you need anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096543
    m_Localized: Hello, I need some new gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096544
    m_Localized: You got weapons, ammo or armor?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096545
    m_Localized: I don't mind contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096546
    m_Localized: Hello, I got some weapons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096547
    m_Localized: You interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096548
    m_Localized: Hello, I got some special stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096549
    m_Localized: For friends of Lower Levels only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096550
    m_Localized: Take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096551
    m_Localized: Hey, I heard you are a trusted merchant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096552
    m_Localized: Are you interested in having a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096553
    m_Localized: I'll take any chemical supplies you got too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096554
    m_Localized: Hello, you are authorized to buy from us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096555
    m_Localized: Here's some surplus equipment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096556
    m_Localized: 15% off if you take everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096560
    m_Localized: Wow, it's so gritty down here. I love it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096561
    m_Localized: Hey, this place has real charm. Super authentic.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096562
    m_Localized: Took a wrong lift or two, but I figured I'd explore a bit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096563
    m_Localized: This part of the station has character, you know?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096564
    m_Localized: Everyone said not to come down here. So naturally, I had to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096565
    m_Localized: I've seen vids about places like this, but being here? Totally different vibe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096566
    m_Localized: So... I'm starving. You got anything local to snack on?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096567
    m_Localized: I heard I could maybe find a little fun down here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096568
    m_Localized: Something to eat, drink... and take the edge off?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096569
    m_Localized: Got snacks, drinks and whatever helps people relax around here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096570
    m_Localized: Anything edible, drinkable, and, uh, recreational?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096571
    m_Localized: Food, water... and something for the soul?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096576
    m_Localized: I'm visiting from another Station. This place is wild!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096577
    m_Localized: They said the Lower Levels were sketchy, but I think it's got flavor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096578
    m_Localized: Exploring the 'authentic' parts of the station today. Very cultural!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096579
    m_Localized: So, do you sell weapons? Like, something I can bring back as a souvenir?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096580
    m_Localized: I'd love to bring home a real piece of street life. Got any weapon?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096581
    m_Localized: Got any small arms I could, y'know, frame or display back home?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302702096582
    m_Localized: Looking for a weapon, just something cool to show my friends back home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290688
    m_Localized: Heard you can find some wild weapons down here. I couldn't resist checking!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290689
    m_Localized: Is this where locals shop?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290690
    m_Localized: This shop looks exactly like the ones in those travel blogs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290691
    m_Localized: Wow, this is a real local shop, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290692
    m_Localized: Is this one of those hidden gems everyone talks about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290693
    m_Localized: Got any old junk? Like something rusted!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290694
    m_Localized: I'm looking for some authentic scrap part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290695
    m_Localized: Just need a piece of local history. A broken panel would be amazing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290696
    m_Localized: Got a rusted scrap or something? Would make a great conversation piece!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290697
    m_Localized: I want some varieties
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290698
    m_Localized: Hello, I work for the Lower Levels Food Bank
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290699
    m_Localized: Our charity can only buy food with 50% discount
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290700
    m_Localized: But we will put in a good word for you in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290701
    m_Localized: We will also glady accept any donations after our budget is used up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290702
    m_Localized: I've been told you are discreet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290703
    m_Localized: I need access cards, meds and melee weapons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290704
    m_Localized: Let's say I will be visiting the Upper Levels soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290705
    m_Localized: I need some equipment for a big job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290706
    m_Localized: I need weapons, bullets, armors and meds
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290707
    m_Localized: They told me you are the one to see for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290744
    m_Localized: Hello there, I was hoping you could help me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290776
    m_Localized: Alright, I will overlook it for this week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290777
    m_Localized: Goodbye, see you next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290778
    m_Localized: Need more goods worth {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290779
    m_Localized: Hello, I want to buy some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290780
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290781
    m_Localized: You there! I am sojourning in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290782
    m_Localized: I wish to sample your more... ahem... "illicit" pleasures...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290783
    m_Localized: Tipple, tobacco... Anything!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290784
    m_Localized: Hello, I need some poisons or chemical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290785
    m_Localized: I got a <i>rat</i> problem.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290786
    m_Localized: Hello, I want to buy some food.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290787
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290788
    m_Localized: I need some variety.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290789
    m_Localized: Hello, I want to buy some household items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290790
    m_Localized: I got {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290791
    m_Localized: I need a variety of stuff
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290792
    m_Localized: Hello, I got these to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290793
    m_Localized: If you take everything, I'll give you 15% off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290794
    m_Localized: And do you have alcohol or cigarettes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290795
    m_Localized: That's not what I am looking for
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290796
    m_Localized: That looks promising.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290797
    m_Localized: Yes, I am looking for alcohol and cigarettes. You got any?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290798
    m_Localized: You got a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290799
    m_Localized: '''Ere, got Materials to sell.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290800
    m_Localized: Take everything, I'll give you 33% off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290801
    m_Localized: Find the right customer, and you'll shift these easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290802
    m_Localized: You've got yourself a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290803
    m_Localized: Alright, I got fresh Nutrifruit for sale, you buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290804
    m_Localized: Freshly harvested Nutrifruit here, if you're buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290805
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit from today's harvest, yours for the right price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290806
    m_Localized: Got Nutrifruit for sale. Fresh picked. Keen?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290807
    m_Localized: Nutrifruit, picked 'em by hand myself. Interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290808
    m_Localized: Just pulled these from my hydroponic farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290809
    m_Localized: These came straight from my hydroponic setup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290810
    m_Localized: Grew this lot myself. Impressive, eh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290811
    m_Localized: Fresh as the day is new. Have a look for yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290812
    m_Localized: From crop to countertop. No fuss. All by hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290813
    m_Localized: Hey there, I've got Food Stamps to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290814
    m_Localized: If you've got Scrap Metal or Materials, I'm buying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290815
    m_Localized: Got any Scrap Metal or Materials for sale?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290816
    m_Localized: Need Scrap Metal and Materials for my next project, you selling?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290817
    m_Localized: Could use some Scrap Metal and Materials, got any?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290818
    m_Localized: Looking for Scrap Metal or Materials, trading?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290819
    m_Localized: I have a few Modules and other bits to trade!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290820
    m_Localized: I even brought some hardware of my own to trade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290821
    m_Localized: Look here, I've got all kinds of hand-crafted gadgets to trade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290822
    m_Localized: This is some of the equipment I've been working on, interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290823
    m_Localized: How about these? All tested, and some even work!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290825
    m_Localized: How's it going?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290826
    m_Localized: I spent weeks on this custom order...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290827
    m_Localized: But the client never came to pick it up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290828
    m_Localized: So, it's for sale. Think you could use it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290829
    m_Localized: Hello, fellow merchant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290830
    m_Localized: I am willing to buy any type of item
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290831
    m_Localized: Except contraband.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290832
    m_Localized: but only with a {0}% discount on the market price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290833
    m_Localized: without the retail markup.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290834
    m_Localized: I have {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290835
    m_Localized: Hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290836
    m_Localized: I am willing to buy any contraband you got
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290837
    m_Localized: and any access card.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290838
    m_Localized: but only at a discount on the market price
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290839
    m_Localized: I have {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290844
    m_Localized: Are you interested in having a look?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290845
    m_Localized: I'll take any Chemical Supplies you got too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290846
    m_Localized: Right then, I've got some ore here to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290847
    m_Localized: Hey, just got back from a mining run, got some ores.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290848
    m_Localized: In the market for ore? This here is from my last expedition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290849
    m_Localized: Struck it lucky on my last expedition. You buying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290850
    m_Localized: Got some ore to sell, straight from the rock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290851
    m_Localized: If you take everything, I'll drop the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290852
    m_Localized: Take the whole batch, I'll give you a discount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290853
    m_Localized: I'll lower the price for you if you take the lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290854
    m_Localized: Buy the lot, and I'll strike you a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290855
    m_Localized: I'll let you take the whole haul for a good deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290857
    m_Localized: Found this lot while scavenging.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290858
    m_Localized: Dug up some useful stuff along my usual route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290859
    m_Localized: Look what I uncovered on my last run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290860
    m_Localized: Managed to scav myself a decent haul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290861
    m_Localized: Did some "urban foraging", see anything you like?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290862
    m_Localized: Picked up a few odds and ends you might like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290863
    m_Localized: Thought you'd be interested in my latest spoils.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290864
    m_Localized: One man's trash is another man's treasure, eh?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290865
    m_Localized: Managed to scrounge up some useful stuff, 'ave a peek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290866
    m_Localized: You trading? Came into some decent salvage lately...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290867
    m_Localized: If you take everything, I'll cut you a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290868
    m_Localized: I'll give you a better deal if you buy the whole whack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290869
    m_Localized: Take the whole lot off my hands, I'll let you keep a few credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290870
    m_Localized: I'll offer you a better price for the lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290871
    m_Localized: Buy everything, and you'll get yourself a nice discount.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290872
    m_Localized: Might get you a deal if you take the lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290873
    m_Localized: I'll give you a discount on the whole lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290874
    m_Localized: Clear me out, and I'll lower my asking price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290875
    m_Localized: I can offer you a better price if you take it all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290876
    m_Localized: If you're interested in the lot, I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290877
    m_Localized: Hey, I got some goodies to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290878
    m_Localized: Take a peek and don't ask questions.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290879
    m_Localized: Hey, I got some goodies to unload.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290880
    m_Localized: Take a quick peek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290881
    m_Localized: Hey, We just hit the Commissary last night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290882
    m_Localized: Check out the haul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290883
    m_Localized: I got all kind of supplies in stock for your store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290884
    m_Localized: But you gotta pay a premium.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290885
    m_Localized: Hello! I sell all kind of essential supplies for store like yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290886
    m_Localized: But there is a premium price for my goods.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290887
    m_Localized: I'll come visit your store every week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290888
    m_Localized: I have water to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290889
    m_Localized: Take everything, and I'll make it worth your while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290904
    m_Localized: 'How did you save up all those credits? '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290905
    m_Localized: That's impressive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290906
    m_Localized: Well, the store is yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290908
    m_Localized: Hello. I have a proposition for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290909
    m_Localized: I am thinking of installing vending machines in front of your store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290910
    m_Localized: You can manage them and earn a nice passive income.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290911
    m_Localized: In exchange for a tiny rent increase, what do you say?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290919
    m_Localized: Suspicious item was seen in your display case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290920
    m_Localized: I will be conducting a full inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290921
    m_Localized: Remain calm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290922
    m_Localized: This is a routine security inspection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290923
    m_Localized: Hello
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290924
    m_Localized: I got some blood to sell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290925
    m_Localized: If you take them, I will buy some food and water in return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290927
    m_Localized: Hello friend!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290928
    m_Localized: I heard your business is doing quite well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290929
    m_Localized: You know
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290930
    m_Localized: 'The Upper Levels banks do not offer loans '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290931
    m_Localized: to the honest people of Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290932
    m_Localized: They believe it's too risky
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290933
    m_Localized: But not us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290934
    m_Localized: We are interested to offer you a mortgage to purchase this store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290935
    m_Localized: Of course the interest are a bit higher than the Banks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290936
    m_Localized: I will visit you again on Sundays once you have 5000 Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290937
    m_Localized: '[Agree and make the down payment ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302706290938
    m_Localized: '[Decline, save up to buy on your own]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484992
    m_Localized: '[Ask him to come back in a week]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484993
    m_Localized: Make sure you can make all the payments before we go forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484994
    m_Localized: Hello, I'm back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484995
    m_Localized: Are you ready to take out a loan with us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484996
    m_Localized: I just bought the property in cash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484997
    m_Localized: I see, goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484998
    m_Localized: Hello, I'm back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710484999
    m_Localized: Are you ready to take out a loan with us
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485000
    m_Localized: to buy this store?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485001
    m_Localized: The current value of the property is {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485002
    m_Localized: We negotiated the down payment on your behalf with the Landlord.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485003
    m_Localized: The down payment is {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485006
    m_Localized: Good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485007
    m_Localized: I will be back next week to collect the first payment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485008
    m_Localized: I am sure you can imagine what happen if you don't pay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485009
    m_Localized: Goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485010
    m_Localized: I understand, we won't bother you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485011
    m_Localized: Good luck, Goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485012
    m_Localized: Ok I will be back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485013
    m_Localized: '[Make payment ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485014
    m_Localized: '[Don''t pay]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485015
    m_Localized: Hello, I am back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485016
    m_Localized: Do you have the weekly payment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485017
    m_Localized: Good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485018
    m_Localized: That was your last payment.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485019
    m_Localized: It was a pleasure doing business with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485020
    m_Localized: The store is yours, for good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485021
    m_Localized: Goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485022
    m_Localized: Good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485023
    m_Localized: I will be back next week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485024
    m_Localized: Goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485025
    m_Localized: If you can't pay, we will take it away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485026
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485027
    m_Localized: Alright, these will do for now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485028
    m_Localized: Make sure you get your payment next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485029
    m_Localized: If you can't pay, we will take it away
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485030
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485031
    m_Localized: Look like you got nothing worth it anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485032
    m_Localized: In that case I am seizing the store.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485033
    m_Localized: Pack your stuff and get out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485034
    m_Localized: Hello, I am buying supplies on behalf of Security Department.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485035
    m_Localized: We need food and medical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485036
    m_Localized: We will also glady accept any donations after our budget is used up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485037
    m_Localized: I never thought I'd end up down here, Upper Levels can be brutal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485038
    m_Localized: Lost everything up top. One rival, one bad deal, and poof.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485039
    m_Localized: I need to sell something of value, fast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485040
    m_Localized: I need cash, quick. Can you help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485041
    m_Localized: Hello, I heard you guys are struggling
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485042
    m_Localized: We got some stuff to donate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485043
    m_Localized: Hello, I am from the Lower Levels Lottery Commission.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485044
    m_Localized: I haven't seen you before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485045
    m_Localized: Are you familiar with the Lower Levels Lottery?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485046
    m_Localized: It's a weekly lottery drawn on Saturday morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485047
    m_Localized: Wining the jackpot mean enough money to live in the Upper Levels forever.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485048
    m_Localized: There's also smaller prizes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485049
    m_Localized: If you won any of those, you can redeem them with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485050
    m_Localized: Interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485051
    m_Localized: Hello, would you like to buy some lottery tickets?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485052
    m_Localized: The jackpot is huge!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485067
    m_Localized: Do you have food?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485068
    m_Localized: Are you stocking {0} at the moment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485069
    m_Localized: Hello, I am from the Station Trade Board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485070
    m_Localized: I am here to notify you that starting next week,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485071
    m_Localized: all shop must have a business permit to continue to operate legally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485072
    m_Localized: I can issue you one for {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485073
    m_Localized: otherwise, I will have to report you to Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485074
    m_Localized: Unless of course, you have a little <i>donation</i> for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485075
    m_Localized: We will talk more about that next time I visit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485076
    m_Localized: Unless you are buying the permit, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485077
    m_Localized: Hello, I am from the Station Trade Board.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485078
    m_Localized: You need a business permit to operate here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485079
    m_Localized: I can issue you one for {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485080
    m_Localized: otherwise, I will have to report you to Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485081
    m_Localized: and they will give you a fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485082
    m_Localized: We wouldn't want that, would we?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485083
    m_Localized: If you were to tip me some goods now, I might be able to overlook it for this week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485084
    m_Localized: Give me a total of {0} Credits worth of goods,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485085
    m_Localized: and I might be able to overlook it for this week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485086
    m_Localized: Hello, I am back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485087
    m_Localized: Are you ready to get your business permit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485088
    m_Localized: otherwise, I will have to report you to Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485089
    m_Localized: and they will give you a fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485090
    m_Localized: or are we considering some donation for this week?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485091
    m_Localized: Give me a total of {0} Credits worth of goods,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485093
    m_Localized: '[Buy the Permit ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485094
    m_Localized: Here is your business permit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485095
    m_Localized: Goodbye.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485096
    m_Localized: '[Refuse]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485097
    m_Localized: In that case, I will have to report you to Security.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485098
    m_Localized: They will start an investigation and fine you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485099
    m_Localized: Keep doing this too long and you might even get shut down.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485100
    m_Localized: Goodbye, I will be back next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485101
    m_Localized: '[Don''t Buy the Permit Right Now]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485102
    m_Localized: Ok, see you next week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485103
    m_Localized: I'm back!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485104
    m_Localized: Hello, I have some meds to sell
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485105
    m_Localized: If anyone asks, this didn't come from me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485106
    m_Localized: '<i>*finishes the transaction and quickly runs off*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485107
    m_Localized: Got any smokes? Or something stiff to drink?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485108
    m_Localized: That looks good
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485109
    m_Localized: '[Pay Rent ({0})]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485110
    m_Localized: '[Don''t pay the rent]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485111
    m_Localized: '[Buyout the store ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485112
    m_Localized: Hello, you better have the rent or I am evicting you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485113
    m_Localized: Hello, do you have the rent?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485114
    m_Localized: Right then. Your rent for the next week is {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485115
    m_Localized: Don't forget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485116
    m_Localized: What? I warned you already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485117
    m_Localized: Alright I am calling Security, you are evicted!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485118
    m_Localized: That is unacceptable!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485119
    m_Localized: I will come back next week
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485120
    m_Localized: and you will pay all the money you owe me
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485121
    m_Localized: For this time and this time ONLY.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485122
    m_Localized: if you don't pay your rent again, I WILL evict you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485123
    m_Localized: Goodbye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485124
    m_Localized: '[Accept Water Vending Machine (+150 Weekly Rent)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485125
    m_Localized: '[Accept Vending Machine (+150 Weekly Rent)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485126
    m_Localized: '[Decline for now]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485127
    m_Localized: Good, I'll have it installed right away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485128
    m_Localized: See you on sunday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485129
    m_Localized: Ok, I'll let you think about it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 517302710485130
    m_Localized: See you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8845232842784768
    m_Localized: I got some scrap for sale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 16989008211787776
    m_Localized: I am also buying any seeds you got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081953751040
    m_Localized: Hey, have you seen the news?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081978916864
    m_Localized: Something's wrong with the new brain implants they just released.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081978916865
    m_Localized: Apparently the AI inside those implant went rogue and were able to take over their host.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081978916866
    m_Localized: Those taken over by the implants are being referred as Augs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081978916867
    m_Localized: They are pretending to be normal while kidnapping and augmenting more people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081978916868
    m_Localized: Here, I got this for you. Don't worry, I already handled the paperworks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081978916869
    m_Localized: Security now mandate every shopkeeper to kill any Aug on sight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081991499776
    m_Localized: The Augs haven't learn to perfectly mimic normal human behavior.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081991499777
    m_Localized: Use the gun only if you are certain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081991499778
    m_Localized: Don't try to call Security, the Augs somehow got access to their communications network.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 17116081991499779
    m_Localized: Good luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056013885440
    m_Localized: Damn it! The Aug is gone again?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245568
    m_Localized: If you see an Aug again,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245569
    m_Localized: You better shoot it on sight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245570
    m_Localized: They hacked into our comms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245571
    m_Localized: Alright, stay safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245572
    m_Localized: We got your call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245573
    m_Localized: Let's check the suspected aug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245574
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245575
    m_Localized: Looks like this is indeed an aug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245576
    m_Localized: Good kill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245577
    m_Localized: Alright, we're taking the aug and leaving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245578
    m_Localized: Hey, what the hell?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245579
    m_Localized: You just killed a real person!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245580
    m_Localized: I am calling this in!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245581
    m_Localized: '<i>*Radio Chatters*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245582
    m_Localized: Alright, looks like you got friends in high places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245583
    m_Localized: We will let it slide for this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245584
    m_Localized: Remember, that gun is only for shooting Augs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245585
    m_Localized: We will start a manslaughter investigation on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245586
    m_Localized: '[Accept Inspection]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245587
    m_Localized: '[Offer Bribe ({0} Credit)]/'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245588
    m_Localized: I have {0} credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245589
    m_Localized: I can spend {0} credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245590
    m_Localized: My budget is {0} credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245591
    m_Localized: 'Budget allocated: {0} credits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245592
    m_Localized: I have {0} credits available for this acquisition.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245593
    m_Localized: 'Allocated funds: {0} credits.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245594
    m_Localized: Hello. I require {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245595
    m_Localized: Picking them up for a friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245596
    m_Localized: Salutations. I'm looking for {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245597
    m_Localized: I am stocking up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245598
    m_Localized: Hi. I need {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245599
    m_Localized: For a friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245600
    m_Localized: Hello. Do you carry {0}?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245601
    m_Localized: Hi. I need {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245602
    m_Localized: Requesting... whatever you have.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245603
    m_Localized: Hey. I need {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245604
    m_Localized: This unit has— I mean, I need some.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245605
    m_Localized: Hi. Requesting {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245606
    m_Localized: Picking them up for a subject that needs attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245607
    m_Localized: A friend is preparing for the augmentation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245608
    m_Localized: For a volunteer who will be needing them soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245609
    m_Localized: Hi. Requesting {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245610
    m_Localized: The augmentation requires proper preparation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245611
    m_Localized: Hello. This unit needs {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245612
    m_Localized: I am helping a subject get ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245613
    m_Localized: Greetings. I require {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245614
    m_Localized: The installation requires preparation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245615
    m_Localized: For a new unit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245616
    m_Localized: For a subject that needs attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245617
    m_Localized: The augmentation can be hard on the body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245618
    m_Localized: Initiating communication. I am a normal human.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245619
    m_Localized: Requesting supplies. A host is awaiting augmentation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245620
    m_Localized: I have {0} credits. Process this efficiently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245621
    m_Localized: Greetings. {0} required.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245622
    m_Localized: Subject preparation for augmentation is underway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245623
    m_Localized: 'Allocated budget: {0} credits. Awaiting your cooperation.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245624
    m_Localized: For a fabrication run I have coming up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245625
    m_Localized: Sourcing for the network.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245626
    m_Localized: The replication process needs specific materials.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245627
    m_Localized: A fabrication run is underway. We need more units.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245628
    m_Localized: Hi. Requesting {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245629
    m_Localized: Replication of the design requires it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245630
    m_Localized: Greetings. I require {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245631
    m_Localized: The fabrication run must not be delayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245632
    m_Localized: Hello. This unit needs {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245633
    m_Localized: For a production run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245634
    m_Localized: For a fabrication purpose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245635
    m_Localized: The chip is almost ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245636
    m_Localized: Greetings. {0} required for augmentation implant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245637
    m_Localized: Production run is behind schedule. The network demands more units.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245638
    m_Localized: 'Budget allocated: {0} credits. Initiating transaction.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245639
    m_Localized: Initiating communication. I am a normal hobbyist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245640
    m_Localized: Requesting {0}. Replication of chip design is underway.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245641
    m_Localized: I have {0} credits. Process this efficiently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245642
    m_Localized: Woah, what's going on?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245643
    m_Localized: WAIT WAIT WAIT, NO NO NO!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245644
    m_Localized: Hey, put that away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245645
    m_Localized: Whoa whoa whoa, easy now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245646
    m_Localized: Please, I don't want any trouble!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245647
    m_Localized: You think I am an Aug??
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245648
    m_Localized: I am a human being! Not a damn Aug!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245649
    m_Localized: Don't shoot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245650
    m_Localized: I am... very scared. Please do not shoot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245651
    m_Localized: I am feeling... fear. Yes. Fear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245652
    m_Localized: I am startled. Like a human.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245653
    m_Localized: My heart is... beating. Like humans do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245654
    m_Localized: I do not want to be shot. For human reasons.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245655
    m_Localized: Please lower the weapon. This is... not optimal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245656
    m_Localized: medical supplies
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18267056043245657
    m_Localized: materials
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19593212294119424
    m_Localized: Hello, we got confirmation that all Augs has been eliminated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19593212319285248
    m_Localized: We appreciate your cooperation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 19593212319285249
    m_Localized: You won't be needed the gun anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24185067702894592
    m_Localized: It's gonna be {0} Credits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24752663099654144
    m_Localized: You can keep the gun for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 24752663145791488
    m_Localized: We can't afford missing out on taking out the Augs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29336952445386752
    m_Localized: Fresh batch, just off the burner. You won't find purer anywhere
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29757499855650816
    m_Localized: Going out at night takes time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29757499893399552
    m_Localized: You won't open as early the next day, and you'll miss a customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29757499893399553
    m_Localized: Hey, If you haven't noticed, there's a display case on your left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29757499893399554
    m_Localized: Place <b>merchandise</b> inside the display case to attract a specific type of <b>buyer</b> to your shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29757499893399555
    m_Localized: Place special items like <b>Neon Signs</b> inside the display case to attract <b>sellers<b>. Here, take these.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29757499893399556
    m_Localized: Place them inside the display case and check the Clientele Interface to see who might come. Make sure to set up your display case before opening the shutter door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 29829888404668416
    m_Localized: So don't feel obligated to go out every night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411756527616
    m_Localized: Well. I taught you all the basics.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887744
    m_Localized: The rest is up to you now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887745
    m_Localized: Remember to buy upgrades, new machines, and expand your contacts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887746
    m_Localized: Once you have more Credits, you can either find someone to offer you a mortgage,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887747
    m_Localized: or buy out the store directly, if you got enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887748
    m_Localized: You can see the property's value on the Calendar Interface.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887749
    m_Localized: Good luck.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887750
    m_Localized: Hello! haven't heard from you for while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887751
    m_Localized: And Dr. Jackson told me you haven't been visiting him as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887752
    m_Localized: Just a friendly reminder that we are here in case you need anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 30060411785887753
    m_Localized: Here, take a look at what I got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928886816768
    m_Localized: Now that's what I call a deal. Thanks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176896
    m_Localized: Generous of you. I'll take it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176897
    m_Localized: Appreciate it. Pleasure doing business.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176898
    m_Localized: Wow. You're really hooking me up. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176899
    m_Localized: This is incredible. I owe you one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176900
    m_Localized: Are you serious? That's amazing. Deal!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176901
    m_Localized: ...Fine. Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176902
    m_Localized: Tch. Alright, you've got a deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176903
    m_Localized: I don't love it, but I'll take it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176904
    m_Localized: Given what's going on out there... fine, I'll take it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176905
    m_Localized: With everything happening right now, I can't really argue. Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176906
    m_Localized: Times being what they are, I'll accept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176907
    m_Localized: Acknowledged. Your terms... are accepted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176908
    m_Localized: Optimal outcome assessed. Deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176909
    m_Localized: Affirmative. Compliance is the logical path.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176910
    m_Localized: ...That's a lot. Fine. You've got a deal, barely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176911
    m_Localized: You're really pushing it. Alright, deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176912
    m_Localized: You're lucky I really needed this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176913
    m_Localized: No, I'll pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176914
    m_Localized: Not interested.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928916176915
    m_Localized: Nope. Not at that price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371200
    m_Localized: Absolutely not. That's robbery.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371201
    m_Localized: Hell no. Find someone else for that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371202
    m_Localized: You're out of your mind. No deal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371203
    m_Localized: Forget it. I'm out of here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371204
    m_Localized: We're done here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371205
    m_Localized: Hell with this, I'm leaving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371206
    m_Localized: You just stretched my budget. I can pick up more now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371207
    m_Localized: Saved me some credits, so my budget for today goes further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371208
    m_Localized: That frees up my budget. Show me what else you've got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371209
    m_Localized: There goes a chunk of my budget. Don't expect me to buy much more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371210
    m_Localized: My budget's tighter now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371211
    m_Localized: That dent in my budget means I'm cutting back on the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371212
    m_Localized: Everyone's going to hear what a snake runs this place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371213
    m_Localized: I'll make sure folks know what kind of store you run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371214
    m_Localized: Bad word travels fast around here. Won't be many coming back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371215
    m_Localized: What?! I'm no criminal. How dare you accuse me of that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371216
    m_Localized: I'm an honest customer. Try that nonsense on someone else.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371217
    m_Localized: Criminal? You've got the wrong person. That's outrageous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371218
    m_Localized: What the hell are you talking about? I'm no aug.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371219
    m_Localized: Aug? You're way off, friend. Better watch your mouth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 36236928920371220
    m_Localized: I'm clean. Pulling a stunt like that could get you hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071261642752
    m_Localized: I'm throwing a party tonight. I need supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002880
    m_Localized: A friend said you sell the good stuff. That true?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002881
    m_Localized: Drink, smokes, the hard stuff. Whatever you've got.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002882
    m_Localized: Your strongest vices. None of the cheap stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002883
    m_Localized: Something to get the party going. Show me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002884
    m_Localized: I've got {0} credits. Make it worth it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002885
    m_Localized: Up to {0}. Quality only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002886
    m_Localized: Here's {0}. Don't sell me garbage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40582071291002887
    m_Localized: Can't get a buzz off that. Don't waste my time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45046653959061504
    m_Localized: Long way down from the Upper Levels. Let's be quick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45046653992615936
    m_Localized: Good. That's what I'm after.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45046653992615937
    m_Localized: Hey. Heard you ain't doing so well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45046653992615938
    m_Localized: I think local businesses like yours are the foundation of our communities.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45046653992615939
    m_Localized: So I'm gonna throw some favors your way. No charge.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45046653992615940
    m_Localized: Take a look.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589267685376
    m_Localized: Sure, that works for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239808
    m_Localized: No problem, the price is fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239809
    m_Localized: Acceptable. The cost is not important.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239810
    m_Localized: That is fine. Funds are not a concern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239811
    m_Localized: Price is irrelevant to the objective. Proceeding.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239812
    m_Localized: Cost parameters are not a limiting constraint. Confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239813
    m_Localized: Resource acquisition takes priority over price. This unit accepts.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45351589301239814
    m_Localized: Monetary value is meaningless. The transaction will complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327783735296
    m_Localized: Hey neighbor! Noticed you haven't given me a ring yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621376
    m_Localized: Give my number a call when you get a chance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621377
    m_Localized: I know all sorts of useful folks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621378
    m_Localized: I can introduce you to people who'll teach you how to farm, clean your water, make wine, and plenty more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621379
    m_Localized: Just dial me up whenever you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621380
    m_Localized: Say, I noticed your display case is still looking a little empty.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621381
    m_Localized: The neon sign will attract <b>sellers</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621382
    m_Localized: The merchandise will attract <b>buyers</b>.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621383
    m_Localized: The more a specific type of goods is worth in your case, the richer the customers it pulls in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621384
    m_Localized: You should always have both on display.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621385
    m_Localized: Make sure it's all set before you open the shutter door.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 45694327867621386
    m_Localized: Anything you add after won't matter until the next day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301099466752
    m_Localized: The chemical purity is actually higher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604096
    m_Localized: Wow, thanks for letting me know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604097
    m_Localized: Are you serious? This is just Nutrifruit starch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604098
    m_Localized: This is actually junk grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604099
    m_Localized: Okay, I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604100
    m_Localized: The purity is off.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604101
    m_Localized: Okay, okay, I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604102
    m_Localized: This is only street standard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604103
    m_Localized: This is only near pharma grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604104
    m_Localized: This is only pharma grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604105
    m_Localized: I didn't know that. I'll lower the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604106
    m_Localized: The chemical purity is incorrect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47224301145604107
    m_Localized: Okay, I'll adjust the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966220115968
    m_Localized: That works.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059008
    m_Localized: That's not what I asked.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059009
    m_Localized: 'Barter for: {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059010
    m_Localized: This water's purity is not as labeled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059011
    m_Localized: What kind of business are you running? This water's purity is off!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059012
    m_Localized: This label's a lie, what kind of scam are you running here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059013
    m_Localized: Are you joking? This is clearly Gutterflow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059014
    m_Localized: Really? This is clearly Rustwater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059015
    m_Localized: According to my test, this is Ghostwater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059016
    m_Localized: According to my test, this is only Basewater
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059017
    m_Localized: This is only High Quality Water. Are you trying to scam me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059018
    m_Localized: This injector is unusable, you can't sell this to me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059019
    m_Localized: This injector is expired!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059020
    m_Localized: The label is wrong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059021
    m_Localized: This is Pharma Grade, not Lab Pure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059022
    m_Localized: This is just Near Pharma.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059023
    m_Localized: This is just the Street Standard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059024
    m_Localized: This is cut!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059025
    m_Localized: This is so impure, even a junkie wouldn't want this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 47469966262059026
    m_Localized: This is just nutrifruit starch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50362190297612288
    m_Localized: What a dull day, so I thought I'd do some shopping.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 50362190322778112
    m_Localized: Show me your best stock.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185904984064
    m_Localized: Hey, rookie. You know everything is negotiable down here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538496
    m_Localized: You can offer <b>Bargains</b> to customers, either by offering them a better price or demanding a better price for yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538497
    m_Localized: If you offer a better price to the customer, you'll gain more reputation with their faction while dealing with that customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538498
    m_Localized: If they're buying, it will also increase their budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538499
    m_Localized: If you demand a better price from the customer, you'll gain less reputation with their faction while dealing with that customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538500
    m_Localized: If they're buying, it will also decrease their budget.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538501
    m_Localized: Customers will always accept a deal that favors them. But if you're demanding a better price, your reputation affects how likely they are to accept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 53229185938538502
    m_Localized: Try it out on the next customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 62674878042259456
    m_Localized: I can't afford Luxury Items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75703065789644800
    m_Localized: That's contraband on your counter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75703065827393536
    m_Localized: That's stolen goods on your counter!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75703065827393537
    m_Localized: That's contraband in your display case!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 75703065827393538
    m_Localized: That's stolen goods in your display case!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77669637500485632
    m_Localized: Are you crazy? I am not drinking this!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77669637538234368
    m_Localized: I am not drinking this, do you want to kill me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77669637538234369
    m_Localized: I'd rather not risk it with Ghostwater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77669637538234370
    m_Localized: I am not drinking this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77672419972399104
    m_Localized: '[Offer {0} Credits]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 77672419976593408
    m_Localized: '[Decline]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84253943287037952
    m_Localized: The yearly interest rate is {0}%
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 84253943316398080
    m_Localized: You must pay {0} Credits every week for {1} weeks
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897668009984
    m_Localized: Need something accurate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564416
    m_Localized: Need something with serious firepower.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564417
    m_Localized: Need something big and intimidating.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564418
    m_Localized: Got something accurate? Maybe a suppressed one?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564419
    m_Localized: I need something stylish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564420
    m_Localized: I need something reliable, bonus if it's suppressed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564421
    m_Localized: I need something intimidating, the bigger the better.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564422
    m_Localized: Nothing fancy. A gun that shoots straight and does not jam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564423
    m_Localized: I want a proper sidearm, well rounded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564424
    m_Localized: A serious piece, no weak spots. Every detail you get right adds to the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564425
    m_Localized: Hold on. Got a melee weapon? I can spend {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564426
    m_Localized: Give me your best {0}. I pay what it is worth, and half again on top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564427
    m_Localized: Got {0} ammo for it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564428
    m_Localized: I also want a backup for close quarters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564429
    m_Localized: Got any {0} or explosive?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564430
    m_Localized: I can spend {0} more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 85295897701564431
    m_Localized: I want something that handles well, steady and easy in the hand.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944594010112
    m_Localized: Your recent appraisals have caught the Board's attention.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370240
    m_Localized: The Board would like to promote you to {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370241
    m_Localized: You will earn a higher appraisal fee on every item, but the Board will expect more accurate estimates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370242
    m_Localized: You will also be qualified to appraise new items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370243
    m_Localized: The certification fee is {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370244
    m_Localized: '[Decline for good]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370245
    m_Localized: Congratulations. Here is your new certificate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370246
    m_Localized: And the training material for your new items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370247
    m_Localized: Expect more demanding customers from now on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370248
    m_Localized: Understood. I'll be back in a week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370249
    m_Localized: I see. The Board will not ask again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87488944623370250
    m_Localized: Your current certificate remains valid.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87495551897878528
    m_Localized: Word gets around the Black Market. A shopkeeper with Sentinel Collapse Disorder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87495551897878529
    m_Localized: I got what you need, but the price climbs a little every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87495551897878530
    m_Localized: Still alive, I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87495551897878531
    m_Localized: The price has gone up since last week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 87495551897878532
    m_Localized: See you next week. Try not to die before then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88850639862153216
    m_Localized: Can you work on my {0}? I want it to do better. I pay for the parts you put on it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88850639891513344
    m_Localized: That label is a lie. I'll count it for what it really is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88850639891513345
    m_Localized: Hey, I need some supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88850639891513346
    m_Localized: We are making a move soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 88850639891513347
    m_Localized: You got weapons and meds?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935436865536
    m_Localized: You! You reported me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254144
    m_Localized: Security held me for two days before they figured out they had the wrong guy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254145
    m_Localized: I told you I was the wrong guy and you still reported me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254146
    m_Localized: I just want to buy some groceries.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254147
    m_Localized: So, are you selling me food this time?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254148
    m_Localized: Again?! Why?!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254149
    m_Localized: Morning! Like the new paint job?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254150
    m_Localized: That's what you get for reporting me for no reason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254151
    m_Localized: Have fun cleaning that up!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254152
    m_Localized: Hey, you guys know me. You got the wrong guy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254153
    m_Localized: You are under arrest for vandalism.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254154
    m_Localized: Wait, wait! Please don't report me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254155
    m_Localized: I can keep bringing you cheap food, I promise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254156
    m_Localized: You won't regret it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254157
    m_Localized: Same deal as last time, if you want it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254158
    m_Localized: Wait, please!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254159
    m_Localized: Let me go, and I'll share my formula with you once it's finished!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254160
    m_Localized: Thank you. You may have just saved a lot of people from an Oxymore overdose.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254161
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254162
    m_Localized: My research is almost finished, but I need some chemical supplies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254163
    m_Localized: Security is still looking for me everywhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254164
    m_Localized: Help me, and I'll share the formula with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254165
    m_Localized: Do you have any right now? If not, I can come back in a week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254166
    m_Localized: The more you give me, the sooner I can finish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254167
    m_Localized: That's plenty, thank you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254168
    m_Localized: I'll come back as soon as it's finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254169
    m_Localized: Hey, I finished it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254170
    m_Localized: Thank you for helping me, and for not turning me in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254171
    m_Localized: I'll try to get off the station now and make my research public.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89343935445254172
    m_Localized: Here's the formula.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047478210560
    m_Localized: Are you sure you want to do that, friend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736512
    m_Localized: Meat this fresh is hard to come by. Somebody always pays for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736513
    m_Localized: I bring the meat, you sell it. Nobody has to ask where it came from.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736514
    m_Localized: Nobody holds me for long. When I get out, I'll come back for your meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736515
    m_Localized: Shit! This guy is huge! Get more people in here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736516
    m_Localized: Hello again. I'm back with fresh meat.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736517
    m_Localized: Hey, I heard you've got a problem with {0}.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736518
    m_Localized: That guy has been causing trouble for my Crew as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736519
    m_Localized: How about you chip in {0} Credits, and we take care of the problem for you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736520
    m_Localized: You can pay through the <b>Nightly Service</b> terminal whenever you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736521
    m_Localized: Wait, don't report me!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736522
    m_Localized: I don't have much to do with the Revolution anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736523
    m_Localized: If you let me go, I'll put in a good word with the young blood of the Revolution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736524
    m_Localized: Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736525
    m_Localized: Hold on, don't do that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736526
    m_Localized: If you don't report me, I can keep bringing you Security gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736527
    m_Localized: I'm sure you can find buyers who'll pay good money for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736528
    m_Localized: Hey, I'm back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736529
    m_Localized: I got some Security "surplus" gear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736530
    m_Localized: You interested?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736531
    m_Localized: I guess tools would do the trick too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736532
    m_Localized: Maybe a plasma cutter, or a screwdriver?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736533
    m_Localized: Morning, sleepyhead!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736534
    m_Localized: While you were sleeping, I hid a little present somewhere in your stuff.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736535
    m_Localized: It goes boom at midnight. Tick, tock!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736536
    m_Localized: Better find it before you go to bed, Nutrifruit. <i>wink</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736537
    m_Localized: Hey Nutrifruit, did you like the "bomb" I left you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736538
    m_Localized: You should have seen your face! <i>chuckles</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736539
    m_Localized: Anyway, I've got some errands to run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736540
    m_Localized: Can you keep my box of toys safe for me for a bit?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736541
    m_Localized: You'd better not touch anything inside, or else. <i>wink</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736542
    m_Localized: Thanks!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736543
    m_Localized: Hey, I'm back! Did you miss me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736544
    m_Localized: I'll take my stuff back now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736545
    m_Localized: Somebody took a little peek inside my box, didn't they?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736546
    m_Localized: Oh, don't look so guilty, you naughty Nutrifruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736547
    m_Localized: A girl's allowed to have her little hobbies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736548
    m_Localized: Maybe next time, I'll show you how they work. See you soon! <i>wink</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736549
    m_Localized: You didn't even take a peek?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736550
    m_Localized: Such a good little Nutrifruit. I could just eat you up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736551
    m_Localized: See you soon!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736552
    m_Localized: Hmm? Something's missing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736553
    m_Localized: I told you not to touch my toys, Nutrifruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736554
    m_Localized: Naughty Nutrifruits get punished. <i>wink</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89676047532736555
    m_Localized: Here's another little present. This one's real. Bye-bye!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422362210304
    m_Localized: Hello, my friend! Today is your lucky day!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404608
    m_Localized: Georgio got himself a brand new backpack, so the old one has to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404609
    m_Localized: Big discount, just for you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404610
    m_Localized: Hello, my friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404611
    m_Localized: As you already know, Georgio is the greatest scavenger there ever was.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404612
    m_Localized: So why not help out other scavengers?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404613
    m_Localized: Georgio now offers his assistance at the Dumping Ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404614
    m_Localized: Want to give it a try? {0} Credits for {1} nights of help!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404615
    m_Localized: '[Accept ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404616
    m_Localized: Excellent! Georgio will meet you at the Dumping Ground tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404617
    m_Localized: Nobody gets hurt when Georgio is around!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404618
    m_Localized: No problem, my friend. Maybe next time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404619
    m_Localized: My friend! Georgio is starting a new business!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404620
    m_Localized: Georgio is always lucky, so why not sell some luck?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404621
    m_Localized: Behold, Liquid Luck! First one's free!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404622
    m_Localized: Hello, my friend! So, how did you like the Liquid Luck?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 89710422366404623
    m_Localized: Georgio has one last batch to sell. Get it while it lasts!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627569414144
    m_Localized: Alter, do you have anything to open?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774272
    m_Localized: Like crate or keycard?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774273
    m_Localized: Get as much as you can, I'll come back to buy them in a week.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774274
    m_Localized: Hallo, do you have the crates or keycards?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774275
    m_Localized: Alter, let's open one right now!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774276
    m_Localized: GOLD GOLD GOLD
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774277
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774278
    m_Localized: Scheiße!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774279
    m_Localized: My friend! Georgio has something for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774280
    m_Localized: Georgio found a young man at the Dumping Ground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774281
    m_Localized: He asked Georgio to bring you this letter. Georgio did not read it. Much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774282
    m_Localized: Hello again, Citizen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774283
    m_Localized: Cadet Serpico has been seen back in the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774284
    m_Localized: The reward for him has been raised to {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774285
    m_Localized: We are counting on you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774286
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me, Serpico.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774287
    m_Localized: The evidence is out. The whole station has read it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774288
    m_Localized: A few low-ranking officers are facing charges. The ones at the top walked away clean.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774289
    m_Localized: So I joined the Revolution. If the system won't clean itself up, we will.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774290
    m_Localized: Thank you for everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774291
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me, Serpico. Back in uniform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774292
    m_Localized: The officer you referred took the evidence all the way to the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774293
    m_Localized: Officers of every rank are facing charges, the high-ranking ones too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774294
    m_Localized: And I've been transferred to the new anti-corruption task force.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774295
    m_Localized: Thank you. Security owes you one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774296
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me, Serpico.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774297
    m_Localized: The Black Market paid well for the evidence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774298
    m_Localized: Enough to get my family out of the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774299
    m_Localized: We're leaving the station for good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774300
    m_Localized: Before I go, I want you to have something. Pick whichever you need.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774301
    m_Localized: Take care of yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774302
    m_Localized: Goodbye, and thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774303
    m_Localized: '[Revolution]: Hand it to the Revolution'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774304
    m_Localized: The Revolution... Working with the enemy?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774305
    m_Localized: But maybe that's what it takes to get through to this station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774306
    m_Localized: Alright. I'll find a way to get it to them. Thank you for hearing me out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774307
    m_Localized: '[Black Market]: Sell it and escape'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774308
    m_Localized: The Black Market would pay a lot for this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774309
    m_Localized: Enough to get my family out of the Lower Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774310
    m_Localized: It's not justice, but at least I can keep my family safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774311
    m_Localized: '[Security ({0} reputation required)]: Hand it to a trusted high ranking officer'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774312
    m_Localized: You trust them? It might actually stick. With their name behind it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774313
    m_Localized: It's the right way to do it. I'll hand it in tomorrow morning. Thank you, truly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774314
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me, Serpico. Thanks for the food you dropped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774315
    m_Localized: I've been busy since we last spoke. I went through all the evidence I grabbed before I left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774316
    m_Localized: It's all compiled now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774317
    m_Localized: But I can't walk into a Security office with it, and I don't know who else on this station I can trust.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774318
    m_Localized: You hear everything from behind that counter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774319
    m_Localized: 'So I''m asking you: who should I hand this document to?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774320
    m_Localized: You silly Nutrifruit, it's me, Lou!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774321
    m_Localized: Hahaha, I can't believe you fell for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774322
    m_Localized: Haha, not bad. You saw right through my disguise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627598774323
    m_Localized: Sharp eyes, Nutrifruit. Smart and cute? Careful, I might start to like you. <i>*wink*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968576
    m_Localized: So, what do you think? <i>*twirls*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968577
    m_Localized: This uniform looks good on me, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968578
    m_Localized: The previous owner won't be needing it anymore. <i>*chuckles*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968579
    m_Localized: Remember my "guest"? He finally opened up to me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968580
    m_Localized: He gave me the location of someone I have a score to settle with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968581
    m_Localized: Now, you pocketed my bounty when you called Security on me,
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968582
    m_Localized: so I'd say you owe me a favor or two.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968583
    m_Localized: Settling this score's gonna take some new toys, and you're getting them for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968584
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits'' worth of weapons, ammo and meds, and we''re even.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968585
    m_Localized: I'll be back in a week. Don't keep a girl waiting, Nutrifruit. <i>*wink*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968586
    m_Localized: Knock knock, Nutrifruit! Did you miss me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968587
    m_Localized: I'm here for my new toys. Weapons, ammo and meds, {0} Credits' worth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968588
    m_Localized: And don't try to slip me anything funny. I borrowed every scanner Security owns. <i>*wink*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968589
    m_Localized: Put them on the counter whenever you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968590
    m_Localized: '[That''s All I Have]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968591
    m_Localized: Ooh, I like this one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968592
    m_Localized: That's everything I asked for. Good Nutrifruit!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968593
    m_Localized: That's it? You're still {0} Credits short.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968594
    m_Localized: I'll take the rest in cash, then. <i>*wink*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968595
    m_Localized: You don't even have that much? Then I'll take everything in your register.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968596
    m_Localized: Well, it was fun playing with you. See you again someday, maybe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968597
    m_Localized: That's not even half of what you owe me, Nutrifruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968598
    m_Localized: And here I thought we were having so much fun.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968599
    m_Localized: Guess I'll settle this score the old-fashioned way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90055627602968600
    m_Localized: Here's one last present. This one's real. Bye-bye! <i>*wink*</i>
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236836507648
    m_Localized: Hello there. You know Eleanor, don't you? I'm her... uncle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256384
    m_Localized: We put together a little care package for her. Only the finest goods from the Upper Levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256385
    m_Localized: I can't seem to find her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256386
    m_Localized: Could you give this to her the next time she comes by?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256387
    m_Localized: Make sure it's in her hands. Not yours. Hers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256388
    m_Localized: And if anyone asks, you've never seen me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256389
    m_Localized: Oh, and keep Security out of this. Family matters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256390
    m_Localized: Hello, Shopkeeper. You reported a stolen item?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256391
    m_Localized: I didn't steal it! Here's the receipt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256392
    m_Localized: Then why did you report this item as stolen?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256393
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256394
    m_Localized: Filing a false theft report is a crime. You're coming with us!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256395
    m_Localized: Freeze! That crate was reported stolen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256396
    m_Localized: What? It's not mine! I've never seen it before!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256397
    m_Localized: Like mother, like daughter. You're coming with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256398
    m_Localized: Please, someone set me up! Shopkeeper, tell them!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256399
    m_Localized: Hey, I've been thinking about what's next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256400
    m_Localized: I'm sure someone in the Upper Levels framed my mother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256401
    m_Localized: I can't go up there and ask questions, but a private investigator could.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256402
    m_Localized: A good one costs {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256403
    m_Localized: So I'll keep scavenging the Dumping Ground and sell you what I find.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256404
    m_Localized: Give me a fair price, okay? Every credit gets me closer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256405
    m_Localized: Thank you! Only {0} more Credits to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256406
    m_Localized: Hey, it's me again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256407
    m_Localized: '{0} more Credits and I can hire the investigator.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256408
    m_Localized: Here's what I found at the Dumping Ground this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256409
    m_Localized: Okay, I think I've got enough credits now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256410
    m_Localized: Thank you. I'm going to find out who did this to my mother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256411
    m_Localized: '<i>*Tell her about the man who said he was her uncle*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256412
    m_Localized: My uncle? I don't have an uncle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256413
    m_Localized: He left a crate for me? One that was reported stolen?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256414
    m_Localized: They wanted me arrested. Just like my mother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256415
    m_Localized: I... I need some time to think about this.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256416
    m_Localized: But you warned me. Please, take something. It's all I have left from home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256417
    m_Localized: I'll come back when I've cleared my head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256418
    m_Localized: Hey. The investigator found something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256419
    m_Localized: A data drive, hidden in my mother's old lab at the hydroponics farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256420
    m_Localized: It's locked, but I know the password. Mom always used my birthday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256421
    m_Localized: I can't wait any longer. Let me open it here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256422
    m_Localized: '<i>*reads the screen*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256423
    m_Localized: This is... genetic research. On Nutrifruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256424
    m_Localized: She found a way to make standard Nutrifruit yield seeds again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256425
    m_Localized: Any decent biohacker could modify it with this data.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256426
    m_Localized: No more buying seeds from pastel. This could seriously damage pastel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256427
    m_Localized: That's why they went after her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256428
    m_Localized: The embezzlement charges were made up. All of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256429
    m_Localized: pastel's corporate representative on the station set the whole thing up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256430
    m_Localized: I... I need some time to think about what to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256431
    m_Localized: Remember me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256432
    m_Localized: We know you've been in touch with Eleanor. And we know about the data drive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256433
    m_Localized: Tell her to give it back to us, or her mother dies.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256434
    m_Localized: If she hands it over, we'll free her mother. She'll be exiled to the Lower Levels, but she'll live.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256435
    m_Localized: And if you get her to give it back, there's {0} Credits in it for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256436
    m_Localized: Don't take too long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256437
    m_Localized: '<i>*Tell her about the offer to free her mother*</i>'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256438
    m_Localized: They'd free her if I give the drive back?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256439
    m_Localized: Exiled down here... but alive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256440
    m_Localized: And if I put it out there, they kill her. But nobody would ever need pastel's seeds again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256441
    m_Localized: I don't know what to do. What would you do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256442
    m_Localized: '[Give the drive back and save her mother]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256443
    m_Localized: '[Leak it to the Lower Levels paper]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256444
    m_Localized: You're right. She's all I have left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256445
    m_Localized: I'll give it to them. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256446
    m_Localized: You're right. This is bigger than us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256447
    m_Localized: Mom would have wanted everyone to have it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256448
    m_Localized: I'll take it to the Lower Levels paper today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256449
    m_Localized: Hey! My mom's free.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256450
    m_Localized: They exiled her to the Lower Levels, but we're together again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256451
    m_Localized: We scavenge the Dumping Ground together now. It's not the life we had, but it's ours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256452
    m_Localized: Thank you for everything you did for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256453
    m_Localized: I bought this for my mom's birthday right before this whole thing happened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256454
    m_Localized: She won't need something like this anymore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256455
    m_Localized: I want you to have it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256456
    m_Localized: I don't think I would have made it this far without you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256457
    m_Localized: I hope I'll see you again sometime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256458
    m_Localized: Take care of yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256459
    m_Localized: Thanks again. For everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256460
    m_Localized: Hey. It's me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256461
    m_Localized: They killed my mom the morning the paper came out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256462
    m_Localized: I joined the Revolution. They'll help me make pastel pay, and keep me out of the corporation's reach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256463
    m_Localized: I bought this for my mom's birthday. I guess it doesn't matter now. I want you to have it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90295236874256464
    m_Localized: Now, I need a weapon. What have you got?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789824167936
    m_Localized: Hey neighbor! I heard the news.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333760
    m_Localized: You own this place now. Congratulations, that's no small thing down here!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333761
    m_Localized: Now that you've proven yourself a capable merchant, I've got something new for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333762
    m_Localized: Ever heard of Hypertech?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333763
    m_Localized: Incredibly useful stuff, way beyond anything the industry on this station can produce.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333764
    m_Localized: Even the Upper Levels can't get their hands on it easily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333765
    m_Localized: I know a smuggler who deals in it. I can refer you, for a considerable fee, of course.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333766
    m_Localized: 'But I''ll warn you: every step of getting those items will be very expensive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333767
    m_Localized: Give me a call when you're ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333768
    m_Localized: Joe Wild sent me. Let's keep this quick.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 90598789849333769
    m_Localized: Here's what I could get my hands on this time. The price is the price.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91072420257775616
    m_Localized: Okay, I'll come back in a week. Please have some chemical supplies ready by then.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91072420274552832
    m_Localized: Still {0} Credits' worth to go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91072420274552833
    m_Localized: Good. Her hands, not yours. I'll know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91072420274552834
    m_Localized: I don't have any family left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91072420274552835
    m_Localized: That's all I have today. {0} more Credits and I can hire the investigator.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 91851101476384768
    m_Localized: Take that filter out first. I only want to buy the water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491328
    m_Localized: And good Nutrifruits get a treat. Go on, pick one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491329
    m_Localized: Ooh, good choice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491330
    m_Localized: '[Call in a favor ({0} Lower Levels rep+)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491331
    m_Localized: For a friend of the Lower Levels? Say no more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491332
    m_Localized: '[Give her {0} Credits]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491333
    m_Localized: Shopkeeper. A word about the girl we picked up here, Eleanor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491334
    m_Localized: She swears someone set her up. She says you might be willing to post her bail.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491335
    m_Localized: Bail is set at {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491336
    m_Localized: '[Pay her bail ({0} Credits)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491337
    m_Localized: '[Vouch for her ({0} Security rep+)]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491338
    m_Localized: Paid in full. She'll be out by tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491339
    m_Localized: Ok, you've done a few favors for us. We will let this slide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491340
    m_Localized: Suit yourself. She stays where she is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491341
    m_Localized: Security let me go. They said it was thanks to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491342
    m_Localized: That crate wasn't mine and I don't have an uncle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491343
    m_Localized: Someone wanted me behind bars, just like my mother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92499267755491344
    m_Localized: I won't forget this. Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341568
    m_Localized: The young man is very hungry, yes? Georgio happens to have a crate of Nutrifruits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341569
    m_Localized: For {0} Credits, Georgio drops them off for you. You do not have to bring a single bite!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341570
    m_Localized: Hmm... but Georgio hears you cannot go to the Dumping Ground these days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341571
    m_Localized: No worries! Georgio happens to have a crate of Nutrifruits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341572
    m_Localized: For {0} Credits, Georgio drops them off for you. Otherwise, Georgio fears the young man will not make it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341573
    m_Localized: Excellent! The young man will eat like a king tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341574
    m_Localized: A friend of yours is a friend of Georgio!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341575
    m_Localized: No problem, my friend. Georgio trusts you to feed him yourself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92502523311341576
    m_Localized: Georgio understands. Let us hope the young man finds food on his own.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676211060736
    m_Localized: Woah, what's going on? Put that thing away!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420864
    m_Localized: '<i>*turns the body over*</i> Hold on. Cadet Serpico.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420865
    m_Localized: '<i>*chuckles*</i> The kid who couldn''t keep his mouth shut. The boys are going to love this.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420866
    m_Localized: Now, strictly speaking, that gun of yours is for Augs only.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420867
    m_Localized: But between us? You just saved the department a lot of paperwork.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420868
    m_Localized: We'll write it up as a capture. The bounty's yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420869
    m_Localized: Wait. You're reporting me? Now?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420870
    m_Localized: Well, look who it is. The cadet turned Revolutionary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420871
    m_Localized: It's already out there. Every name. Arresting me changes nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420872
    m_Localized: Who said anything about arresting?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420873
    m_Localized: Let's get him bagged.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420874
    m_Localized: No... We were leaving tonight. My family is waiting at the docks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420875
    m_Localized: Then they'll wait a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420876
    m_Localized: Good call, Citizen. One less loose end.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420877
    m_Localized: No augs on this one... hold on. Li Bei Wen? The chemist?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420878
    m_Localized: Oh, you did good, Citizen. That man was dangerous. Very, VERY dangerous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420879
    m_Localized: Hehe, I'll probably get a bonus from the corporate rep for closing this case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420880
    m_Localized: The bounty's yours. We'll take the body.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420881
    m_Localized: Wait. I know this face. {0}, from the wanted list.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420882
    m_Localized: That gun is for Augs, Shopkeeper. Point it at a citizen again and we'll have a very different conversation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420883
    m_Localized: But nobody's going to lose sleep over a dangerous criminal. We'll log it as a capture. The bounty's yours.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420884
    m_Localized: ARGH! You'll pay for that
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420885
    m_Localized: Whoa, you are scaring me...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420886
    m_Localized: Remain calm. Please. Remain... calm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420887
    m_Localized: This is a routine security inspection. A routine one. Very routine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420888
    m_Localized: This one is... special. Orders from the top.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420889
    m_Localized: So, uh. Open your cargo hold and step aside. Quickly, before my shift... I mean, before the end of my shift.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420890
    m_Localized: That includes the shotgun. Hand it over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420891
    m_Localized: Your weapon permit covers the shotgun. Keep it, for self defence.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420892
    m_Localized: Ooh. Careful with that, Nutrifruit. You only get one shot at me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420893
    m_Localized: AHH!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420894
    m_Localized: ...Where did you get that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420895
    m_Localized: I know that little toy. Republic issue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420896
    m_Localized: You could have hidden it in my things. You showed it to me instead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420897
    m_Localized: They will come for me now. Fine. Let them come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420898
    m_Localized: I am sorry about before. Now I need to ask for your help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420899
    m_Localized: I need weapons, ammo, meds. Everything you can spare. Please.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420900
    m_Localized: Put it on the counter. Whatever you can spare.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420901
    m_Localized: '[That''s All I Have]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420902
    m_Localized: Good. More, if you have it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420903
    m_Localized: That will do. That will do nicely.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420904
    m_Localized: Thank you, Nutrifruit. You will hear from me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420905
    m_Localized: It might not be enough. Not to sound ungrateful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420906
    m_Localized: It will have to do. Wish me luck, Nutrifruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420907
    m_Localized: Shopkeeper, my team and I have been tracking a woman by the name of Lou for a while now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420908
    m_Localized: We believe you just met her. She is a traitor to the Republic and a terrorist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420909
    m_Localized: Those regular Security officers will not hold her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420910
    m_Localized: She will come back here, and she will want to play.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420911
    m_Localized: She is a psychopath, but a predictable one. Be patient. Play along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420912
    m_Localized: Take this transmitter. Hide it inside something she takes away with her. A box, a crate, anything that leaves with her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420913
    m_Localized: When it reaches her hideout, we move in. There is intel in there the Republic needs extracted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420914
    m_Localized: Help us capture her and {0} Credits are yours. Not a word of this to anyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420915
    m_Localized: The woman you shot yesterday. You are the first person in years to put a hole in her. Congratulations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420916
    m_Localized: She is a traitor to the Republic and a terrorist. And she does not forgive. She will haunt you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420917
    m_Localized: Your best chance is to cooperate with us.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420918
    m_Localized: Take this transmitter. She will come for payback. Whatever she makes you hand over, hide it inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420919
    m_Localized: '{0} Credits now, for your trouble. Another {1} when we have her. Not a word of this to anyone.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420920
    m_Localized: It is done. We have her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420921
    m_Localized: The Republic is grateful. Here's your {0} Credits.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420922
    m_Localized: She is going to rot in a black site for the rest of her life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420923
    m_Localized: It is done. We have her. It cost us two good people.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420924
    m_Localized: Somehow she knew we were coming. Funny, that.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420925
    m_Localized: Your {0} Credits, as agreed. The Republic keeps its word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420926
    m_Localized: Security will be keeping a close eye on this store from now on. Just in case.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420927
    m_Localized: You read the news, I take it. An admiral of the Republic, dead on this station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420928
    m_Localized: She did this, and we could have stopped her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420929
    m_Localized: I thought we had a mutual understanding about her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 93341676240420930
    m_Localized: You are lucky we have to leave soon to track her down, or we would have looked further into your involvement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94001378955673600
    m_Localized: I know a weapons dealer around here. {0} Credits would cover the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 94001378997616640
    m_Localized: '[Give her {0} Credits]'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
